# game/script_dlc.rpy:10495
translate chinese drunk_fight_a5c2eb71:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}几杯烈性艾尔下肚，与你同桌喝酒的一个士兵突然开始嘲笑你，讥讽你身板单薄，还说你没上过战场。他话里渐渐冒出“软蛋”“雏儿”之类的词，明摆着是找茬讨打。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10497
translate chinese drunk_fight_c408a166:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这家伙确实该受点教训，可正值战事，在军营里打架可不是什么明智之举，闹大了少不了一顿重罚。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10499
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_19:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10503
translate chinese drunk_fight_97b2ffaa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定教训教训这个无赖，用拳头跟他做个了断。可一想到营地里打架会招来重罚，你便飞快地盘算起最妥当的出手方式……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10505
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10512
translate chinese drunk_fight_01fd260c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你打小就明白，街头斗殴哪有什么规矩和荣誉可言。于是趁那家伙分神的当口，你抡起拳头一通猛揍，把他撂翻在地。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量、敏捷——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10514
translate chinese drunk_fight_f08b8687:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}周围的士兵起初被你的举动惊得一愣，不过很快就有几人朝你点头，露出赞许之色。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10516
translate chinese drunk_fight_a98eb598:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）+1！{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10518
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10522
translate chinese drunk_fight_d5008898:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你打小就明白，街头斗殴哪有什么规矩和荣誉可言。于是趁对方分神的当口，你挥拳便打。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10524
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10526
translate chinese drunk_fight_32b590f0:

    "{cps=50}可他显然早有防备，侧身躲开了你的攻击。两人随即扭打成一团，场面一片混乱。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量、敏捷——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10527
translate chinese drunk_fight_f18bac5f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这场架没能打多久——没过片刻，一名怒气冲冲的军士便赶来打断，先是喝令众人把你们拉开，随即给你们一人赏了几记结实的耳光。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10529
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10532
translate chinese drunk_fight_1d5d7738:

    "{cps=50}好在军士没有把此事上报，你们俩总算躲过了一场严惩。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10533
translate chinese drunk_fight_15ddc503:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过这事传开后，你在同袍们心里的分量可一点没见长。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10535
translate chinese drunk_fight_2b5c4ea6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10538
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10541
translate chinese drunk_fight_ce361630:

    "{cps=50}军士决意重重教训所有卷入此事的人，下令将你们统统绑起来抽鞭子。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10542
translate chinese drunk_fight_c781ec7a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}倒霉的不止你们俩打架的，旁边几个没掺和的士兵也跟着白白挨了顿打。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10544
translate chinese drunk_fight_ba452d2f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}说起来你算是轻省了，这种事闹大了，轻则戴上镣铐，重则掉脑袋。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10546
translate chinese drunk_fight_909e22eb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你的同袍们可不像你那么想得开，对这顿轻罚非但不领情，反倒深深记恨上了你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10548
translate chinese drunk_fight_f83190a4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-6！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10551
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10555
translate chinese drunk_fight_abfb9719:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你既不想冒受重罚的风险，又不屑于背后下黑手。于是你提议，与那家伙约在城墙边一处僻静地，来一场堂堂正正的拳脚较量，把恩怨当面了断。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10557
translate chinese drunk_fight_660e568b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10560
translate chinese drunk_fight_3b0a7434:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他一口答应，两人便朝城墙走去。可还没走到地方——你刚一转脸，让他溜出视线，背后便挨了一连串重拳。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10562
translate chinese drunk_fight_35f0ebd5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你根本来不及招架。还没等想明白发生了什么，人已经趴在泥地里，脑袋嗡嗡作响，嘴里满是血腥味。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10564
translate chinese drunk_fight_2f5e7789:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一双快手匆匆翻遍你的衣兜，把钱掏了个干净。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}金币-10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10567
translate chinese drunk_fight_da8cd401:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}等你缓过神来，父亲当年的一句话浮上心头——'荣誉，是骑士、贵族小姐和装腔作势的蠢货才讲究的东西。'"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10569
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10573
translate chinese drunk_fight_5dd68086:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不想惹上没必要的麻烦，便试着打个哈哈，想把气氛圆过去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10575
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10580
translate chinese drunk_fight_06faa6d1:

    "{cps=50}好在你的舌头还算灵便，轻轻松松便回了他一句又好笑又扎心的俏皮话，逗得四周众人哄笑不止，把那个挑衅的家伙臊得满脸通红。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10581
translate chinese drunk_fight_18da8196:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这场冲突就此平息。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）+2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10584
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10586
translate chinese drunk_fight_5a3e7e2e:

    "{cps=50}可惜幽默并非你的长处，本想用刻薄话刺他一下，结果弄巧成拙。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10587
translate chinese drunk_fight_6f4b16e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}冲突虽然就此平息，可你在众人眼里显然没落着赢家的名头。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10589
translate chinese drunk_fight_352af837:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-3！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10592
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10596
translate chinese drunk_fight_90dc8cd8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你让那家伙嘴上放干净点，明摆着告诉他：再不收敛，拳头伺候。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10598
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_18:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10600
translate chinese drunk_fight_71257020:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}真要动手的架势立马浇灭了他的气焰。他缩了回去，把方才那些放肆话推说是想逗新兵一乐，只是玩笑开砸了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10602
translate chinese drunk_fight_91ae0424:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这场冲突就此化解。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10604
translate chinese drunk_fight_76b2fe88_10:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10606
translate chinese drunk_fight_597de7e7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管你尽力摆出威猛的架势，语气也硬邦邦的，可这副强撑的狠劲显然没能唬住对方。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10608
translate chinese drunk_fight_728ca726:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}面对你的威胁，他理所当然地反问一句——'……不然呢？'。要想保住脸面，看来只剩下动手一条路了。"

