# game/script_dlc.rpy:10685
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_94daf498:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你与其他士兵围坐在篝火旁，随手抄起一把鲁特琴试着拨弄起来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10687
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_0cfe00d5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你对乐器一窍不通，指望着边弹边摸、临阵磨枪。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10689
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_9d0ef303:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可事情好像有点不对劲。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10691
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_2ad500a2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}也不知道是这把鲁特琴不听话，还是你的手指太笨太粗太慢——总之，琴弦里蹦出来的不是悦耳的旋律，而是各种鬼哭狼嚎的刺耳噪音，惹得周围众人纷纷侧目。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10693
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_cbe0dfef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}没过多久，围在篝火边休息的士兵们就把你轰走了，嫌你搅了他们难得的清静……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10695
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10697
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_34460ca6:

    "{cps=50}你之所以没被连赶带踹，全靠军士这个军衔替你挡着。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10700
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_91693610:

    "{cps=50}为了保险起见，他们还额外赏了你屁股一脚。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10702
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10707
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_551dc4d7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你与其他士兵围坐在篝火旁，又抄起鲁特琴试着拨弄起来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10709
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_bc5737e5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这次你多少有了点起色，不过离弹出悦耳的音乐还差着十万八千里。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10711
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_4c1460cd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}于是没过多久，你又被轰走了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10714
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_f422ec20:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，尽管屡屡受挫，你心里隐约觉得，自己正走在正道上。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:10716
translate chinese player_lute_fail_event_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

