# game/script_dlc.rpy:11030
translate chinese castle_heist3_a0a32296:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}把看中的东西尽数卷走后，你们匆匆踏上归途。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11032
translate chinese castle_heist3_53899523:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}运气似乎站在你们这边，回程一路平安无事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11034
translate chinese castle_heist3_5422a305:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可就在某个幽暗的走廊里，你面前的一扇门猛地被推开……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11036
translate chinese castle_heist3_9de4e57c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……一名卫兵从门里出来，与你撞了个面对面。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11038
translate chinese castle_heist3_447b5e58:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}黑暗中他勉强辨认出你的轮廓，喝问来者何人。你一时不知如何应对，忙朝走在前头的巴塞洛缪与同伴们投去目光。他们正拼命向你打着手势，可在这片昏暗中，你实在辨认不出他们的意思。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11040
translate chinese castle_heist3_aef482b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}形势转眼间便危急起来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11042
translate chinese castle_heist3_76b2fe88_15:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11046
translate chinese castle_heist3_51b327a1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你明白此刻已别无选择，遂认定这是唯一可行的路——攥紧拳头，用尽全力，朝那卫兵的下巴抡了一记横扫的摆拳。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11048
translate chinese castle_heist3_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11052
translate chinese castle_heist3_27750dea:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}许是你天生神力，也许是那卫兵困意未消——他麻袋似的栽倒在地，你则拔腿就逃。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11055
translate chinese castle_heist3_21cb2d80:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你狂奔着逃出塔楼，一路上总觉得身后追兵将至、随时可能被逮住……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11057
translate chinese castle_heist3_8ec78495:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可几分钟后，当你终于逃到外面的沟壑边，才惊讶地发现：四周的夜色静谧如常，唯有你自己粗重的喘息声。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11059
translate chinese castle_heist3_857cc320:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}巴塞洛缪带着几分促狭的笑意拍了拍你的肩，夸你果决。他还念叨了几句什么“往昔的好日子”，你却听得云里雾里。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11061
translate chinese castle_heist3_48c8548d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一路无事回到营地，你安然睡下，脑中回味着方才的冒险，心里美滋滋地想着：兴许自己刚交上了几个不错的朋友。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11063
translate chinese castle_heist3_1c8b7b0f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）+5！{vspace=5}巴塞洛缪成了你的朋友。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11068
translate chinese castle_heist3_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11074
translate chinese castle_heist3_88141a15:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}任务完成经验：+[temp_experience_number]"

