# game/script_dlc.rpy:11083
translate chinese castle_heist3_d3770520:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管你倾尽全力挥出这一拳，还是打了个空，结结实实地落了下风。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11085
translate chinese castle_heist3_848040e9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那卫兵转瞬间便缓过神来，一把抽出腰间佩剑，一边高声呼救，一边左右乱劈。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11090
translate chinese castle_heist3_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

