# game/script_dlc.rpy:11270
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_c62287ab:

    "{cps=50}尽管你打定主意，无论如何也要把同袍救出来，可究竟怎么个救法，你心里其实还没个准谱。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11271
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_25205277:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}望着远处沉入夜色的东塔轮廓，你在心里盘算着种种可行的法子。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11273
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_29d390f3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可以试着偷偷潜入塔内。可这样的事几乎不可能成事，风险岂止是大——简直是九死一生。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11275
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_a435ef6e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}更不必说，在这里哪怕出半点差错，赔上的就可能是自己的性命。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11277
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_a3843512:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你想到的第二个法子，是扮成城堡守军的一员混进去。若能挑准时机、趁夜色行事，溜进去的机会还是有的。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11279
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_cb51d460:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过要玩这套把戏，至少得有身像样的行头——黑灯瞎火里也要能混充个正经士兵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11281
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_e64a1f10:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}没有头盔和护甲——哪怕是最破旧的——这套法子就永远行不通。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11283
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_377305b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最后，还可以试着收买某个卫兵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11285
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_4ea21057:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}巴塞洛缪那帮人对他们的评价可不怎么样，说不定只要一把叮当作响的银币，就有人乐意睁一只眼闭一只眼。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11288
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11294
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11297
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_9cf7488f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管军士劝过你，关乎性命时别吝惜钱财，你还是决意赌上性命，潜入那座塔楼。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11300
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_36183fbd:

    "{cps=50}虽说你手里还有好些更靠谱的盘算，可最后你还是决定铤而走险，独自潜入塔楼。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11301
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11305
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_bc9c59be:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}起初，运气似乎颇为眷顾你。潜入城堡围墙之后，你在僻静处候到入夜，趁换岗的空当，溜进了东塔。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11307
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_93a2a9ef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可一进塔，麻烦便接踵而至。你对塔内布局一无所知，压根猜不准囚犯会被关在什么地方。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11309
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_ab2b8732:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你眼下唯一能做的，就是凭感觉摸索着走。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11311
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11315
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_35eda225:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定从顶层开始找起。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11317
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_55dfa0fa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你逐间屋子仔细搜寻，竭力不弄出半点动静……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11319
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_9815d077:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你推门时，某扇门板猛地发出一声刺耳的吱嘎，把你彻底暴露了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11322
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11324
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_630bdf6f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定从中层开始找起。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11326
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_55dfa0fa_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你逐间屋子仔细搜寻，竭力不弄出半点动静……"

