    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11536
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_6e3e48cf:

    nvl clear
    "{color=#A9A9A9}你连最低限度的一笔贿赂都掏不出来！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11538
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_19:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11540
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_ba7b0c17:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}想起军士的劝告——生死攸关之际别吝惜钱财——你决定这次不拿命去赌，改赌钱包。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11542
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_c7b9cc2c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你成功与一名卫兵搭上了线，他似乎不介意夜里收你一笔钱，放你进塔。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11544
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_e79644bc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过他并不急着开价，摆出一副等你先出价的架势。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11546
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_31:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11551
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_3bc1e7af:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你报出的数目让对方的脸色瞬间垮了下来——他让你别浪费他的时间，还补了一句：十个弗罗林，他顶多朝你脸上啐一口。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11553
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_20:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11561
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_21:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11563
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_c486e8d3:

    "{cps=50}你报的数目虽然没让卫兵动心到哪去，却也让他犯了会儿嘀咕。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11564
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_34f11726:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}沉吟片刻之后，他到底还是应下了这桩事，不过强调：他只管帮你混进塔里，余下的事一概与他无关。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}金币-20！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11566
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_dc60554b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他还叮嘱道：从你踏进塔里的那一刻起，你便也是他的敌人了。他会大发慈悲，容你领先几分钟，可一旦再被他撞见，他立刻鸣钟示警。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11568
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_66c6f0c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}入夜后，到了约定时分，那名卫兵领你从一处暗道钻进塔里，随即便撒手不管了。你只好独自在幽暗的走廊里摸索前行。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11570
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_ab2b8732_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你眼下唯一能做的，就是凭感觉摸索着走。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11572
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_28:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11576
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_35eda225_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定从顶层开始找起。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11578
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_55dfa0fa_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你逐间屋子仔细搜寻，竭力不弄出半点动静……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11580
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_9815d077_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你推门时，某扇门板猛地发出一声刺耳的吱嘎，把你彻底暴露了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11584
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_630bdf6f_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定从中层开始找起。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11586
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_55dfa0fa_3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你逐间屋子仔细搜寻，竭力不弄出半点动静……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11588
