    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11593
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_c99b94f5_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}思忖片刻，你断定囚犯多半被关在地下某处，便决定从底层找起。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11595
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_abed5f3e_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你贴着阴影、屏息凝气，慢慢排查地窖的各个房间，好一会儿后，终于发现了牢房。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11597
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_3bb2b572_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}全都空空如也……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11599
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_23a101a4_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}唯有最后一间——你在那里找到了巴塞洛缪：他被揍得鼻青脸肿，但好歹还活着。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11601
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_238d801d_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你找来近旁一条木凳，借力把铁栅栏撬了下来，把巴塞洛缪放了出来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11603
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_bb02d965_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你暗暗祈祷方才的动静没惊动任何人，小心翼翼地往外撤。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11605
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_76b2fe88_23:

    nvl clear
    ""

