# game/script_dlc.rpy:11610
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_75e03bed_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}仗着一身不错的力气，你把同伴架到自己身上，搀着他前行。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11612
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_049c00b2_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}天意依旧眷顾于你，回程出奇地平安。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:11614
translate chinese jailbird_quest1_c47754e5_2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}路上偶尔撞见的几名卫兵，都被你轻易藏进阴影躲了过去，不久便顺利溜出了塔。"

