# game/script_dlc.rpy:12423
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_canteens_6fd1c900:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}面对他们满腹牢骚的追问——见鬼，说好的水呢？——你含糊其辞，把一切归咎于林间遭遇的法军袭击，说是货物因此失落。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:12425
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_canteens_31a1964e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你的说辞显然打动不了这些士兵。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-25！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:12427
