# game/script_dlc.rpy:12462
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_letter_9ea6fb3f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你随一支骑兵小队回到营地，向军士复命，汇报任务完成。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:12464
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_letter_7da0452c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听闻法军袭击之事，他头一件事便是问那封信是否无恙。确认信完好无损后，他夸了你几句，还答应在伯爵面前替你说几句好话。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）+5！{vspace=5}+50弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:12466
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_letter_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:12470
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_letter_df1295ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你随一支骑兵小队回到营地，把遭遇向军士一一禀报。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:12472
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_letter_195b90ef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听闻法军袭击之事，他头一件事便是问那封信是否无恙。得知信已失落，他的脸色顿时沉了下来，说就凭这一桩，你们俩都等着挨指挥部一顿狠批吧。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）-10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:12476
translate chinese waterboy_quest_ending_letter_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

