    "{cps=50}接下来几天，你在冰冷牢房的铁栅后度过，身子也跟着遭了罪。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13275
translate chinese monk_city_3_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13277
translate chinese monk_city_3_1a587b81:

    "{cps=50}所幸你运气不坏——没过多久，你便被用来交换了几名被伯爵的人俘虏的法国战俘。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13278
translate chinese monk_city_3_76b2fe88_3:

