# game/script_dlc.rpy:13429
translate chinese monk_quest_fail_f0abead1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拖拖拉拉，耽误了太久，终究没能按伯爵与王子的交代扮成修士混进城，令两人大失所望。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）-20！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13432
translate chinese monk_quest_fail_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13439
translate chinese forager_quest1_ae2efc5e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}围城开始后不久，营地的补给便意外地出了些小岔子。{w}你多方打听才弄明白：问题出在从敦刻尔克出发的辎重队——连日大雨把道路泡得稀烂，车队全堵在了半路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13441
translate chinese forager_quest1_48522926:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为免动摇军心、折损战力，国王下令组织一支支征粮队，分赴周边村镇搜罗粮秣。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13443
translate chinese forager_quest1_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13445
translate chinese forager_quest1_d4245da4:

    "{cps=50}你因在康布雷之战中表现出众，入了伯爵的眼，于是被委以一支小队的领队之职。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13447
translate chinese forager_quest1_f6c97723:

    "{cps=50}凭借你在士兵中迅速积攒起的威望，你被委以一支小队的领队之职。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13449
translate chinese forager_quest1_c841d90f:

    "{cps=50}机缘巧合之下，你成了一支小队的领队。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13450
translate chinese forager_quest1_3410bcd0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}军士交给你一张地图，上面标着附近几座需要你前去“拜访”的村庄。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13452
translate chinese forager_quest1_56d956f8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}临行前，军士叮嘱：对当地百姓不必过于凶蛮，却也无需客气——士兵要吃饭，庄稼人总得匀出些口粮，情愿不情愿另说。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13454
translate chinese forager_quest1_667eda7e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他还说，跟村里人打交道，得多留个心眼。英格兰有句老话说得好：“枝头栖野鸡，村里住农民”……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加——[forager.name]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13457
translate chinese forager_quest1_c475c0c9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此外，军士还劝你多留意四周的村落。若你碰巧寻见一处征粮队没顾上、却还藏有不少口粮的好去处，务必回来报与他知晓。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13459
translate chinese forager_quest1_0e6bc9d5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}当然，赏钱是少不了的。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加——[mouths_to_feed.name]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13463
translate chinese forager_quest1_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13469
translate chinese forager_quest_village1_fc549c1b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}约莫两个小时后，你赶到了康布雷以西一座名为巴夫勒尔的村落。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13471
translate chinese forager_quest_village1_a1bb85a2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}村子穷得一眼可见，同行的一名士兵立刻断言：这地方怕是刮不出油水。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13473
translate chinese forager_quest_village1_2f96fb18:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}沿途遇见的庄稼汉个个衣衫褴褛、神色惊惶，全然不像家底殷实、可供搜刮的人家。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13475
translate chinese forager_quest_village1_2a81ab45:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在村里仔细转了一圈，寻到了村长。他的话印证了你的观感——巴夫勒尔无甚可刮，本地人自己都在勉强度日。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13477
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13483
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_a47c30c6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}任凭村长和村民如何抗议哀求，你们仍挨家挨户把农舍仓房扫荡一空，把一袋袋口粮装上了车。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13486
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_b7049de2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你们是在数十名妇孺的哭嚎声中离开村子的。同行的一名士兵低声嘟囔：军令虽为军令，可这做派实在不像基督徒该有的。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13491
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13495
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_e312c24c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不忍夺走人家最后的口粮，又不敢违抗王命，便想寻个折中的法子——提议出钱向村民购买粮秣。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13497
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_2823a76f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}当然，价钱谈不上公道，可好歹聊胜于无，至少能让他们不至于饿死。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13499
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_19f2b665:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}村长思量片刻，开价五十弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13501
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13506
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_95c475a7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你自掏腰包与农民清了账，随后把能搜罗到的些许存粮尽数装进袋囊。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}金币-50！{vspace=5}美德+15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13510
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_be8987c9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途中，你隐约听到两名士兵的交谈——他们感谢你没有逼他们夺人最后一口吃食，赞你是个有德行的基督徒。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）+3！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13516
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13519
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_c82cfd0d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定付钱，可钱包里的数目并不够……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13521
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13526
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_09366bbe:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}要全额自掏腰包，你实在不情愿，便提议由众士兵凑份子。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13529
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_92448dba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拿不出足额的钱，便提议由众士兵凑份子。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13532
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_beeb5961:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}弟兄们对这主意并不买账，可碍于你的威望，加之最基本的道德心，还是咬咬牙掏了钱。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}声望检定通过！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）-7！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13534
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13540
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_c97d0bc1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你与农民清了账，随后把能搜罗到的些许存粮尽数装进袋囊。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13546
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13549
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_99626026:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}没有一个士兵乐意摊这笔钱。你试图说服他们，可惜威望还差些火候。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}声望检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13551
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13556
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13560
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_de6fe790:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见再无转圜的余地，你也只能掉头下令回营。军士也好、伯爵也罢，哪怕国王亲自来催，你也绝不会夺走人家最后一口吃食。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13563
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_24c963b0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回营的路上，你始终放不下一个念头：这是头一回有人托付你如此要紧的差事……而你把事情办砸了。{w}至于回营后与军士那场难堪的谈话，你干脆不去想。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13568
translate chinese forager_quest_decision_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13574
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_8c8c0f65:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你率队向营地的东面进发，不久便来到一座名为费尔阿谢瓦尔的大村落。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13576
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_37617a2f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}入目皆是高大整洁的房舍，村民的穿着在乡村里也算体面——显然，这地方的家底不薄。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13578
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_42dc922a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你还没来得及走到村中心细细察看，一伙手持武器的人便堵住了去路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13580
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_bf05da3c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为首的老者自称本村村长……{w}随即请你们打道回府，明言此地不欢迎劫匪和征粮兵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13582
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_9c97e989:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}村长虽极力避免出言粗野，措辞却也算不上客气，话里话外透出不加遮掩的威胁。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13584
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13586
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13591
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_b8cb5b06:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你岂能容忍一个泥腿子的村汉这般出言不逊、威胁恫吓。懒得与他多费口舌，你一拳砸在那狂妄老头的脸上，随即抄起了家伙。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13594
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13599
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_f3b0d0f3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为免流血冲突，你试图劝住村民：今日若是拒了我们，改日登门的可就是半支王师，届时他们的房舍怕是要夷为平地。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13602
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_c20a77b8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管村民们面色阴沉、满眼不快，却也开始慢慢掂量你话中的分量——说到底，他们并无多少退路。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13604
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_f9ed47a9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}气氛渐渐缓和下来。村长与族人商议一阵后，同意给你们匀出所需的口粮。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13606
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_d9b54350:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他唯一的条件，是让村子从此安宁。{w}这样的安排你求之不得，装满了袋子和筐篮的补给，你便率队回返。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13612
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13629
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_39594bb8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}任凭你如何巧舌如簧，村民也不肯听进半句——他们放话：其一，你长着一副“强盗相”；其二，“你们全是骗子”。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13632
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13636
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_25513d0b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你实在犯不上为几袋面粉跟一群民兵拼个你死我活，于是决定掉头回营。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13638
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_dcbb0db5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你心里还盘算着，早晚得教训教训这帮口无遮拦的农民——不过这场清算，看来只能留待下回了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13640
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_772f5d0e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你还没来得及走出多远，身后便传来一个持械农民的叫嚣：“走啊！滚吧，胆小鬼！”"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13642
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_d7294a30:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你手下的弟兄方才还在庆幸兵不血刃，一听这话顿时变了脸色，纷纷嚷嚷着要掉头杀回去，给那帮狂妄之徒点颜色看看。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13644
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13648
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_65d1dbb6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一声叫嚣成了压垮你耐心的最后一根稻草。你怒火中烧，拔剑掉头。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13650
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_8cd68e69:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}其余士兵呐喊着一同冲了上去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13652
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_c96ada11:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那些已经开始庆贺胜利的农民显然没料到这一手，顿时慌了神，手忙脚乱地试图摆出防御阵型……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13655
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13660
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_a967937f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管士兵们个个摩拳擦掌想大干一场，你还是决定无视这场挑衅，率队折返。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13662
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_f8b55f06:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}士兵们对这个命令极度不满，个个面带愠色。可你心里清楚：正是这份冷静，方才救下了不少性命——其中也包括几个此刻正对你横眉竖目的人。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-10！{vspace=5}威望-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13669
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13684
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_cef7093c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见村子的防线彻底崩溃，村长也随众人丢下了武器，苦苦哀求放过费尔阿谢瓦尔的百姓——莫杀人，莫烧屋。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13686
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_268e8199:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}士兵们只当这是笑话听，几个已经开始摩拳擦掌，盘算着能捞到多少好处……{w}一柄斧头已然举到了村长头顶。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13688
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13692
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_8dd858ef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就在斧刃即将落下的千钧一发之际，你出手喝止了这场处决——你决定留这狂妄的村汉一条性命。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13695
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_046b8c20:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}随后你又下令不得洗劫村庄，只准搜刮战死的民兵身上的装备，并取走需要的那份口粮。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13697
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_c214a330:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}队员们对这样的安排大为不满，声称你夺走了他们应得的战利品。一番争执吵闹之后，你勉强稳住了局面，却也为此折损了声誉。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）-10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13700
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_3cea11a0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最终，你备齐了所需的口粮，离开村庄时，村子未受半分滋扰。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13705
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13719
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_0f4d1fd7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定不阻拦这场处决——这农民咎由自取，蠢笨与狂妄早已替他自己写好了结局。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13722
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_f19470cb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}砍下村长的人头之后，士兵们挨个光顾了几户殷实人家，值钱的东西尽数落进腰包，凡是没钉牢的物件全被顺手牵走。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）+5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13725
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_cabf0a24:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}几个时辰后你终于率队返程时，身后的村庄已不再是当初那座干净富庶的村落——只剩一片浓烟滚滚的废墟。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13730
translate chinese forager_quest_village2_afterfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13747
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_cd051546:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}骑马向营地东南行了几个小时，你寻到了一座名叫康克的小村。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13749
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_ef4ce898:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尚未进村，便有阵阵歌声随风飘来——那曲调绝非法兰西风味，你心里顿时生出一丝不祥的预感。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13751
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_7e085abc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{i}母亲曾对我说，{vspace=5}终有一日我会买下，{vspace=5}一条桨力十足的帆船，{vspace=5}扬帆驶向远方的海岸……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13753
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_273ea025:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}没过多久你便发现，这预感并非多余。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13755
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_56217465:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}村子早被洗劫得干干净净……{w}而下手的，竟是你们的盟友——坎特伯雷伯爵麾下的雇佣兵，他们的营地就扎在康布雷北面。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13757
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_df7a1288:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一小队雇佣兵正扯着嗓子高歌，身上挂满各色战利品，在村边给马上鞍，准备启程。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13759
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_4874cede:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}接到征粮差事的并不止你们一队，各队的搜刮范围早经划分。雇佣兵洗劫康克，分明是越界行事——如此擅作主张，一旦事发，恐怕难逃重罚。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13761
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_af7b4b08:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的到来并未惊动他们——只有几人把兵器换到顺手的方位，警惕地瞄着你们，其余人依旧在收拾马匹。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13763
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_17cba3fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你正要迎上去，一名队员却拉住了你，压低声音告诫：别跟那些雇佣兵起冲突——惹恼他们，是通往坟地最快的一条路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13765
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_e07334e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他又忧心忡忡地补了一句：正朝这边走来的那个雇佣兵，活脱脱像是鲁芬——坎特伯雷伯爵的贴身红人，一个出了名的亡命之徒，这辈子杀过的人，足可以填满一座公墓。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13767
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_6ff24759:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}队友苦苦哀求你不要冒险、不要去招惹他，否则你随时可能成为他名单上的又一个亡魂。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13769
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13777
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_c6f9c6b7:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Не выражающее никаких эмоций лицо наёмника покрыто многочисленными шрамами, а его доспехи - повреждениями, сколами и вмятинами."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13778
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_296bd9be:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Он выглядит как человек, прошедший сотню сражений и не раз смотревший смерти в лицо."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13779
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_5d5b7acc:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}От колючего взгляда его глаз вам становится неуютно."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13781
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_bf5ebdbf:

    r "{cps=50}А вы еще что за оборванцы?"
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13782
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_f4496e38:

    h "{cps=50}Оборванцы это твои родители. А мы фуражиры из отряда эрла Нортхэмптона и прибыли в Конк, чтобы реквизировать продовольствие в соответствии с приказом английского короля."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13783
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_89d2c1a0:

    h "{cps=50}Так что, если не хочешь заиметь большие проблемы с серьезными людьми, прикажи-ка своим людям разгружать мешки обратно и тащить их сюда. Мы всё заберём."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13784
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_c554efc6:

    h "{cps=50}Если сделаете всё достаточно быстро, то я уж так и быть не стану никому рассказывать об этом инциденте."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13785
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_e43d9ed4:

    r "{cps=50}..."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13786
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_3540f53c:

    r "{cps=50}Ха. Я даже не знаю, что производит более жалкое впечатление - твои оскорбления или твои попытки напугать меня."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13787
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_14b7ab06:

    r "{cps=50}А хотя нет. Знаю. Твой внешний вид."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13788
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_eeabe18f:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Заинтересованные разговором люди Руффина и члены вашего отряда тем временем подходят ближе, образуя вокруг вас кольцо и лишая беседу конфиденциальности."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13789
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_a8b7f5d7:

    r "{cps=50}Выглядишь как вонючий свинопас, возомнивший себя воином, вместо того, чтобы убирать навоз."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13790
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_11b095cb:

    h "{cps=50}Следи за языком. Я здесь по приказу короля и я не потерплю..."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13791
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_f5e7b222:

    r "{cps=50}Потерпишь. Заткнёшься и будешь терпеть."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13792
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_8d079e6e:

    r "{cps=50}Будешь терпеть, что я назвал тебя вонючим свинопасом на глазах всех твоих людей. И что мы забрали провиант из этой деревни тоже потерпишь."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13793
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_670a0371:

    r "{cps=50}А еще я могу прямо сейчас плюнуть тебе в лицо и ты и это стерпишь. И ни ты, ни твои друзья голодранцы ничего мне не сделают."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13794
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_f90e9874:

    r "{cps=50}Если, конечно, никто из вас не хочет оказаться в грязи с распоротым брюхом."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13795
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_5749da3d:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Рука Руффина ложится на рукоять меча, красноречиво показывая, что он готов к драке."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13796
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_24d05ac8:

    r "{cps=50}Правда ведь?"
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13800
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_c7f1b6f8:

    h "{cps=50}С распоротым брюхом, говоришь?"
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13801
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_9e6fbdd5:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Наглость наёмника переходит все возможные границы и прощать ему такое неуважение к себе вы не собираетесь. Особенно на глазах нескольких десятков человек."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13802
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_7aa58acb:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Вы достаёте оружие."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13803
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_56ad9daf:

    h "{cps=50}Я научу тебя следить за языком.{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}Репутация (солдаты) увеличена на 10!"
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13805
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_0f5fa12b:

    r "{cps=50}Сомневаюсь."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13813
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13818
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_47b1420f:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Ваш расчет на то, что упоминание имён короля и эрла подействует на наёмника явно проваливается."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13819
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_f668ec04:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Не желая ввязываться в поединок из которого едва ли сможете выйти победителем, вы предпочитаете просто промолчать."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13820
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_ccbda991:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Между кровью и унижением вы выбираете последнее.{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}Престиж снижен на 10!{vspace=5}Репутация (солдаты) снижена на 25!"
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13823
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_d7f0dab0:

    r "{cps=50}Ну вот об этом и речь."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13824
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_917fdf64:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Презрительно усмехнувшись, под одобрительный гогот и шутки остальных наёмников Руффин сплёвывает вам прямо на ботинки."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13828
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_603e64b1:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Вы вновь отвечаете молчанием."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13829
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_1583aa64:

    r "{cps=50}Хороший мальчик.{w}{vspace=5}На. Это тебе утешительный приз. Чтобы совсем с пустыми руками не возвращался."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13830
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_52e66eba:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Похлопав вас по щеке, Руффин бросает на землю монету. После чего с ухмылкой разворачивается и дает своим людям команду собираться."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13835
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_ef3c1538:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一幕显然让你的名声在同伴中间一落千丈……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望-3！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）-10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13839
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_38097156:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，看他们的神情，倒也明白：你们一行方才侥幸捡回了一条命。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13841
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_c7496c7b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}雇佣兵们扬着漫天尘土，唱着歌，往西北方向去了，把你撂在原地。{w}你这才想起鲁芬掷在地上的那枚钱币。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13843
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13847
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_e4680f90:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}钱就是钱，你从没有乱扔钱的习惯。尽管这处境有些难堪，你还是弯腰把它捡了起来……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13850
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_38201db1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}至少……下次碰见鲁芬，还能物归原主。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13852
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13857
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_1d4b0bb6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你任由那钱币躺在泥里，并在心里发誓：下次见面，定要让那雇佣兵为这番羞辱付出代价。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13859
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13862
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13866
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_7d26f102:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Чувствуя закипающую ярость, вы намереваетесь было ответить ему ударом в челюсть, но он оказывается быстрее - и отправляет вас на землю резкой и неожиданной подсечкой."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13876
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_296a1cc2:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Прежде чем вы успеваете встать, Руффин обрушивает на вас еще один удар, ломая нос и втаптывая вашу голову в грязь подошвой своего башмака.{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}[storyroll!ti]"
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13877
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_e53115bb:

    dn "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}Падение и тяжелый удар по голове полностью дезориентируют вас и лишают какой бы то ни было возможности на продолжение боя."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13878
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_dd30f91c:

    r "{cps=50}Как вам, парни? Это я у Де Монфора подсмотрел."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13879
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_085a99c3:

    r "{cps=50}Я ему потом тоже покажу. Чувствую, старику понравится."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13884
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_f6622e65:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}鲁芬居高临下，脸上挂着志得意满的坏笑。可刹那间，他的神情却变了——仿佛眼下的场面，让他忆起了什么。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13886
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_cf5b1ebe:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}好像他曾经也这样居高临下地站在某人面前，品咂着胜利的滋味。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13888
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_c6c7cac6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}又或者，是有人曾这样站在他面前。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13890
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_da93cb0b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他匆匆瞥了你一眼，猛地转身，喝令手下收拾行装。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13892
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_37c22e1f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}片刻之后，雇佣兵们已翻身上马，重新唱起那支歌，朝西北而去，把你甩在身后。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13894
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_1217e3e2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}等你缓过神来、从泥里爬起，你的人已四散在村中，一个个都躲着你的目光。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13896
translate chinese after_coin_pickup_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13899
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_5d434f6f:

    "{cps=50}你心知这村里断然不会再有什么值钱的东西了，却还是决定挨家挨户看上一眼。{w}可一进门，你便撞上了令人作呕的一幕……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13900
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_32eeeeab:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}几乎每一户人家，主人都“迎接”着你……{w}用一双双冰冷、空洞的眼睛。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13902
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13905
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_2c1bc1ad:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}鲁芬的人不仅洗劫了康克，夺走了本该归你的收成，还几乎屠尽了全村的人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13907
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_6bddba44:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若你是个更虔诚的人，眼前的景象只怕会令你毛骨悚然、心生厌恶，恨不得向鲁芬讨还这笔血债。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13909
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_d19118f1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可惜，过分的虔诚从来不在你的美德之列——这幅血淋淋的画卷并未在你心头激起半点波澜。人命本就不值钱，尤其在这战场上，尤其还是别人的命。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13911
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_d7c49176:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可鲁芬当着众人让你受的这份折辱，你绝不容许就此揭过。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13913
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_ac0aae07:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}站在被屠戮一空的村落中央，四周是数十具血肉模糊的尸首，你在心里起誓：这笔账，定要向那雇佣兵讨还。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加——[blood_debt.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13915
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13918
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_72d5c72a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}鲁芬的人不仅洗劫了康克，夺走了本该归你的收成，还几乎屠尽了全村的人。{w}而你，竟眼睁睁放他们扬长而去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13920
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_8f2d3587:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你心知双方实力悬殊，却仍忍不住自责。你在心里起誓：下次相遇，定要教鲁芬为今日之举付出惨痛代价。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加——[blood_debt.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13922
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13924
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_d35163be:

    "{cps=50}返程的路上，你们的小队一路沉默无言。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13929
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13948
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_9fe426e6:

    "{cps=50}回营后，你被直接送去见医师——塞西莉亚瞧见你这副模样，几乎吓坏了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13949
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_50a2fc9b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你刚想开口讲述经过，她便止住你，说你现在最要紧的是保存气力。整个傍晚，姑娘都守在你的床前，忙着料理你满身的伤口。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13951
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_5c3257f2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}起初她严厉地制止你说话，几个时辰后，许是确信你性命无碍，她才渐渐放下心来。到午夜时分，你们已经天南地北地聊开了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13953
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_68b526a6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你终于沉沉睡去，塞西莉亚却还在床边守了很久，护着你的安眠。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13955
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_9d4e0caf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}关系（塞西莉亚）+15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13964
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_86718768:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}伤势痊愈！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:13966
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14001
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14014
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_interaction_end_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14051
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_8ffcd3cf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}出乎所有人的意料，这场本该在几分钟内以你惨败收场的打斗竟僵持不下——不是痛殴无助的孩童，而是一场旗鼓相当的对决，双方谁也压不住谁。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）+10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14054
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_297b44c4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听着鲁芬的喘息愈发粗重，你悄悄蓄起一记势在必得的攻势，指望一举扭转这场决斗的走向。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14056
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_7c33982d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可就在你瞅准时机、举刀劈下的当口，腿上一阵猝不及防的剧痛让你失了平衡，栽倒在地。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14058
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14063
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_7d4c56ae:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}腿部伤势！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14066
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_538d9687:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}活力-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14067
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_84aa8e8c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不明白发生了什么，抬眼一看，才见害你摔倒的元凶——鲁芬的一名手下，一个魁梧的日耳曼大汉，趁你不备暗算了你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14069
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_b809c943:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}整场打斗始终面色如常的鲁芬，头一回露出了恼怒的神情。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14071
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14079
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_d3467059:

    r "{cps=50}Какого чёрта, Андреас!? Сопляк был у меня в руках!"
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14086
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_adce8633:

    un "{cps=50}Вы были в опасности, босс."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14087
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_31e790bc:

    r "{cps=50}В опасности?{w}{vspace=5}Да я даже второй меч не доставал — от тех пейзан с вилами исходило больше опасности, чем от этого горе-дэулянта."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14088
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_b6957b10:

    un "{cps=50}Просто присматриваю за вами, босс."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14089
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_c0110944:

    un "{cps=50}У нас еще много дел впереди — вы сами говорили."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14090
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_e43d9ed4:

    r "{cps=50}..."
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14096
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_d72e3c8a:

    "{cps=50}不过鲁芬的恼怒来得快去得也快，脸上很快又恢复了那副冷冰冰的模样。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14097
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14100
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_1905a4da:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你指望的奇迹终究没有出现——不出所料，与这老练雇佣兵的交手，还是以你的落败告终。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14102
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_215a362a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你一招接一招地挨打，血流不止。又吃下一记重创后，最后的气力也告罄，你软绵绵地瘫倒在地，四周是雇佣兵们肆意的哄笑。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14104
translate chinese forager_quest_village3_afterfight_a0a48355:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}“摔得跟只烂麻袋一样。”鲁芬一边把你的衣衫当成拭剑布，一边点评……{w}{vspace=5}“打起架来，也是这路货色。”"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14106
translate chinese ruffin_first_duel_aftermath_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14109
translate chinese ruffin_first_duel_aftermath_b15d0db4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他向你的队员们询问是否还有人想讨个说法，无人应声。鲁芬耸了耸肩，转身回到自己人中间。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14111
translate chinese ruffin_first_duel_aftermath_06eb4704:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}经过你身边时，他略微放慢脚步，压低声音丢下一句：{vspace=5}“欢迎来到战场，小子。”"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14113
translate chinese ruffin_first_duel_aftermath_a625e9ba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}雇佣兵们离去后，你的同伴们连忙围拢过来，手忙脚乱地替你止血包扎。虽说这场架你没能取胜，可那份敢于向鲁芬挑战的胆气，实打实地为你赢得了士兵们的敬重。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）+5！{vspace=5}美德+5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14117
translate chinese ruffin_first_duel_aftermath_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14123
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_f46a3c5a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}跑遍地图上标出的所有村庄后，你回到营地——军士已在等候。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14126
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_48fa3be9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你满载粮秣而归，他登时笑逐颜开，夸你差事办得漂亮，还答应在伯爵面前替你美言，张罗着尽快给你升迁。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）+20！{vspace=5}+125弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14130
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_bfba534d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听你讲起在康克村与那伙雇佣兵的交锋，他面露困惑，也答应会将此事禀报伯爵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14132
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_71a2fbe6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}在军士那里订购物品的价格下降了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14134
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14137
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_3e00dc14:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你并非空手而归，他登时笑逐颜开，夸你差事办得漂亮，还答应在伯爵面前替你美言，张罗着尽快给你升迁。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）+10！{vspace=5}+65弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14141
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_bc14706c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可一到清点你运回的口粮，军士便发现：这点数目，分明不够三座村子该有的收成。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14144
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_9c7f0919:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你以不忍劫掠乡民为由辩解，惹来他真心的困惑——他反唇相讥：既如此心善，何不把自己的口粮让给别的士兵，饿上几天？"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14146
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14148
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_8d6e5c6a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}作为回应，你把康克村遭遇那伙雇佣兵的事讲给了他听。军士大感意外，答应将此事禀报伯爵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14150
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14153
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_0fd47b49:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你并非空手而归，他先是精神一振；可一弄清你几乎一无所获，那点喜色转眼便化作了恼怒。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14155
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_af69e913:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}按军士的说法，饿死的风险眼下是没有了，可照这成果，往后一周的饱饭怕是别想了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14157
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_6ecae1b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你刚提起这趟远征好歹该有份象征性的犒赏，军士便叫你滚远些，还说随便换个人都比你强，把这差事托付给你，是他看走了眼。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14159
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_59ac63cc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，好歹念在你跑了一趟，他还是扔给你几枚弗罗林，权当辛苦费。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}+35弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14162
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_ae5ebb40:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他让你带着你那些借口赶紧滚蛋，唯独你遭遇雇佣兵的那段讲述，令他眉头紧锁——他郑重答应，会向伯爵禀报此事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14164
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14167
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_daa230d3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你两手空空地回来，军士登时火冒三丈，劈头盖脸骂了一通，说随便换个人都比你强，你把他和伯爵的脸面都丢尽了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）-10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14170
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_dbd68456:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他还说：若来日攻城失利，是因为饿得拿不动武器的士兵们撑不住场面，那要感谢的，就是像你这样的聪明人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14172
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_3b3893e8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你刚开口讨要哪怕象征性的酬劳，军士便叫你滚远些。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14174
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_ae5ebb40_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他让你带着你那些借口赶紧滚蛋，唯独你遭遇雇佣兵的那段讲述，令他眉头紧锁——他郑重答应，会向伯爵禀报此事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14181
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_88141a15:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}任务完成经验：+[temp_experience_number]"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14183
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14186
translate chinese forager_quest_ending_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14191
translate chinese fight_club_05a50406:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为给围城营地里日复一日的沉闷生活添点色彩，桑德兰伯爵身边的一名骑士操办了一场徒手格斗的比武——几位最有分量的领主，每方各出一人参赛。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14193
translate chinese fight_club_3828a0c1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}当你将即将举行的比武大会的消息禀报伯爵时，他正和王子殿下一起埋头谋划着攻取此城的宏图大计，对此并不怎么放在心上。{w}随口便提议派你前往。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14195
translate chinese fight_club_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14197
translate chinese fight_club_688c57ea:

    "{cps=50}你体格算不上出众，对自己并无太大信心，实在难以想象自己能成为出色的拳手。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14198
translate chinese fight_club_5a3eebc4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，胜者除了赢得众人敬重之外，还能获得一笔可观的赏钱——这份诱惑足以让你动心一试。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14200
translate chinese fight_club_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14202
translate chinese fight_club_72f928b9:

    "{cps=50}你体格强健，素来在拳脚上颇有自信，听闻有比武可参加，便饶有兴致地盘算起来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14203
translate chinese fight_club_5c8910c8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而对胜者许下的丰厚赏格，更是让你跃跃欲试。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14205
translate chinese fight_club_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14208
translate chinese fight_club_12f2ea48:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}思忖片刻之后，你接受了伯爵的提议，决定参赛。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14210
translate chinese fight_club_c4ee1682:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}比武的规矩并不复杂：每场较量分为三个五分钟的回合，由裁判依据双方有效击打的多寡判定胜负。若有一方认输、被击昏或以其他方式失去继续比赛的能力，比赛亦可提前结束。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14212
translate chinese fight_club_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14215
translate chinese fight_club_f2fc643c:

    "{cps=50}权衡再三，你还是决定拒绝参赛——战时最不需要的，就是挨自己盟友的拳头。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14216
translate chinese fight_club_8c4a989f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}敌人带给你的伤痛已经够多，实在无须再添一份。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14218
translate chinese fight_club_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14261
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_03db94ec:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的对手是个壮汉，名叫富尔顿·埃弗利，是坎特伯雷勋爵麾下的骑兵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14263
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_d8dff992:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}用“壮汉”来形容富尔顿再贴切不过：他肩宽几乎胜过身长，蛮力惊人。不过和多数大块头一样，他的耐力多半是短板，越到后面的回合越会显露无遗。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14265
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_33f21ea5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}无论如何，与他对阵都不会轻松。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14267
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_b43a8e06:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就在开赛前几秒，你环顾四周聚集的人群，竟在人群中看见了塞西莉亚——她正饶有兴味地注视着你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14269
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_e96e6366:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你与她目光相接，可转瞬间铜锣声响起，宣告开赛，也把你脑中所有杂念一扫而空。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14271
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14278
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_c9525544:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}凭借过人的敏捷，你步伐灵动，轻易将对手控制在称手的距离上，以刺拳不时加两连击招呼他。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14281
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_0d3738ab:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你缺乏力量，出拳几乎没有真正的分量。你固然能凭此得分，但你的戳刺只会惹恼富尔顿——到第二回合时，他几乎没受什么实质伤害。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14284
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_b6d70b79:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的出拳看似轻描淡写，实则每一击都暗含千钧之力。最初挨了几拳时，富尔顿还只是嗤笑，可到回合结束时，他脸上已血迹斑斑，先前那抹讥笑荡然无存。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14288
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14291
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_68b42ea4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你试图与对手拉开距离，却显然高估了自己的敏捷，旋即为此付出了代价。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14293
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_1e216a0b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}开赛伊始，富尔顿便如一头暴怒的公牛向你扑来。你堪堪避过他头两次猛冲，可第三次突进让你猝不及防——那壮汉一记势大力沉的勾拳正砸中你的鼻梁。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14295
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_9aa46ac4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你勉强稳住身形没有倒地，但体力已明显不支。剩余时间里你又挨了记记重拳，优势毫无疑问落到了富尔顿手中。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14299
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14303
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_68983370:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你摆出一副无所畏惧的姿态，第一回合便展开不顾一切的贴身对攻。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14308
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_78d5c4ed:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}观众本以为壮汉能把你像树枝般折弯，谁知战局竟旗鼓相当，令众人大为意外。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14310
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_a9db4f79:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}更甚的是，在近身互换重拳时，多数回合的较量都是你占得上风。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14313
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14315
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_0264e1ca:

    "{cps=50}脸上挨了无数拳的富尔顿摇摇晃晃地熬到回合结束。优势无疑在你手中，可你也为此耗去了大半体力。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}耐力检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14317
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14319
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_dfebf1e2:

    "{cps=50}脸上挨了无数拳的富尔顿摇摇晃晃地熬到回合结束。优势无疑在你手中。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}耐力检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14320
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14324
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_00c27782:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这个打法实在算不上明智：壮汉的重拳砸得你踉跄难稳，远胜过你回敬他的所有攻势。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14326
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_042f8dc2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}富尔顿一记大摆拳正中你的下颌，你瞬间失去对身体的掌控。凭着纯粹的求生本能，你才勉强捱到回合结束。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14330
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14334
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_e496151a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定以精准的反击为核心战术，从容地让对手率先出招，自己只在关键时刻出手，力求把每一次机会用到极致。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14339
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_2583a63b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你侧身躲过富尔顿又一次大幅度的过顶挥拳，随即以一记毒辣的右手直拳回敬——精准如针尖入肉。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}协调性检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14341
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_182c4fee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这记精彩的拳击瞬间扭转了回合的走势，你反客为主，成了咄咄逼人的猎手，而他却成了仓皇逃窜的猎物。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14343
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_5569f17f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}富尔顿勉强支撑到回合结束。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14347
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14349
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_6d01eb49:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}整个回合你都在等待一记能够扭转战局的完美出拳，可这样的机会始终未曾降临。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}协调性检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14351
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_8bcad869:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}富尔顿稳稳拿下这一回合。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14355
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round1_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14361
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_fa0fb6e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第二回合，你决定与对手保持距离周旋。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14365
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14367
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_a95fa37a:

    "{cps=50}耗费了大量体力的富尔顿虽明显迟缓下来，却依旧危险。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14368
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_5112a6ac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而面对你的速度，他依然无计可施。你如老练的斗牛士般绕着他游走，再次以密集的拳雨将他淹没。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14370
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14372
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_e955f24a:

    "{cps=50}不过这些拳的威力依旧差强人意，富尔顿始终没有受到真正的重创。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14373
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_44eef849:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拿下了第二回合，却感到自己已经明显气力不支。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14375
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14377
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_8030fac9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的出拳依旧凌厉。回合将尽时，被打得满脸血污青肿的富尔顿终于栽倒在地，却又踉跄着爬了起来。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14379
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_44eef849_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你拿下了第二回合，却感到自己已经明显气力不支。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14383
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14386
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_6c255164:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你学斗牛士的盘算未能奏效，对手步步紧逼，接连命中于你。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14390
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_c8e8eb42:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}很快你便眼前重影，双腿如灌铅般沉重，几乎连正常的防守都难以维持。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14392
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_c985563f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}富尔顿将你逼到擂台角落，一连串重拳轰来，你倒地之后再也未能起身。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14395
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14397
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_ee5d7519:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第二回合归于富尔顿。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14400
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14404
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_b0c733ea:

    nvl clear
    "第二回合，你以充满自信的近身对攻开局。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14408
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_13:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14410
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_bc5e2ccd:

    "{cps=50}你一连串沉重的躯干打击轰得富尔顿喘不上气，迫使他转入完全的防守姿态。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14411
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_30f638ad:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他的多数反击都绵软无力，到回合结束时，你已毫不怀疑这第二个回合归你所有。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14414
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14416
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_d86903ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见对手几乎不再抬臂格挡，你将残存的气力尽数灌注于最后一拳——这一拳险些把可怜的富尔顿的脑袋打飞。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14418
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_019f42bb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}被击倒的对手轰然砸落在地，过了好几分钟才显露出些许生机。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14421
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14424
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_c85d5f11:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}换来这场胜利的代价，是你体力储备的彻底枯竭。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}耐力检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14427
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14431
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14434
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_49a71b5e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在擂台中央挑起一场惨烈的对攻，可每一次交锋都被对手压制，胜者显然是他。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14437
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14439
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_c8e8eb42_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}很快你便眼前重影，双腿如灌铅般沉重，几乎连正常的防守都难以维持。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14441
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_c985563f_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}富尔顿将你逼到擂台角落，一连串重拳轰来，你倒地之后再也未能起身。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14444
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_10:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14446
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_64b8573a:

    "{cps=50}富尔顿稳稳拿下第二回合。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14448
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_12:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14452
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_95f2b6db:

    nvl clear
    "第二回合，你决定以反击应对。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14456
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_17:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14458
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_64632c93:

    "{cps=50}富尔顿如狂暴的野兽般步步紧逼，却常常门户大开。你抓住破绽，猝然以一记沉重的连击正中他的下颌。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}协调性检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14460
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_15:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14462
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_1bcc047e:

    "{cps=50}对手显然被打得失了方寸，几乎无法再有效防守。了结他不过是时间问题——又挨了十来拳后，富尔顿被彻底击昏。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14464
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_14:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14470
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_6d01eb49:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}整个回合你都在等待一记能够扭转战局的完美出拳，可这样的机会始终未曾降临。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}协调性检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14472
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_8bcad869:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}富尔顿稳稳拿下这一回合。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14474
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round2_76b2fe88_16:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14482
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_177f79b9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第三回合，你决定与对手保持距离周旋。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14486
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14488
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_807b21c5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}气力耗尽、喘如风箱的富尔顿已沦为活靶子。你轻而易举地闪过他迟缓的出拳，再用快速的刺拳与连击尽情回敬。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14491
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_ac0e16b4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}对手硬挺着承受了你的一轮轮打击，始终未被轰垮，一直站到比赛结束。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14497
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_fb2f4acb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在你密集的拳雨下，对手已明显摇摇欲坠。当又一记凶狠的刺拳咔嚓一声打断他的鼻梁时，他终于瘫倒在地，再也未能起身。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14501
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_68b72a06:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}对手硬挺着承受了你的一轮轮打击，始终未被轰垮，一直站到比赛结束。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14505
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_dff5bef4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}到了第三回合，你的疲态也已充分显现，再也无法轻易在速度与敏捷上压过富尔顿。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}敏捷检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14507
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_c1cd6924:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}较量偏离了你的计划，演变成赤裸裸的近身互殴，而对手的拳头显然比你的更有分量。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14510
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14512
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_c8e8eb42:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}很快你便眼前重影，双腿如灌铅般沉重，几乎连正常的防守都难以维持。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14514
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_c985563f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}富尔顿将你逼到擂台角落，一连串重拳轰来，你倒地之后再也未能起身。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14517
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14519
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_c7f4fb1a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第三回合归于富尔顿。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14522
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14526
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_66b1021f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你深知观众想看的是什么，于是决定以一场堂堂正正的正面交锋来为比赛收官。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14529
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_cdd345c2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的决心坚如铁石，可血肉之躯毕竟脆弱。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14531
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_c82b783e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}久战之后，你已精疲力竭，再也扛不住这疯狂的换拳。富尔顿一记重勾拳擦过你的头颅——四周的光亮骤然熄灭。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14533
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14539
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_2ff842fa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}疲惫到极点的富尔顿到了第三回合，不但速度全失，力量也所剩无几，几乎成了静止的靶子。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14541
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_fd6fe738:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你从容避开他稀疏的反击，一次次抡拳如斧，劈头盖脸地招呼在他身上。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14545
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14547
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_d86903ca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见对手几乎不再抬臂格挡，你将残存的气力尽数灌注于最后一拳——这一拳险些把可怜的富尔顿的脑袋打飞。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14549
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_019f42bb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}被击倒的对手轰然砸落在地，过了好几分钟才显露出些许生机。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14552
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14555
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_624c3182:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的决心坚如铁石，可血肉之躯毕竟脆弱。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14557
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_c82b783e_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}久战之后，你已精疲力竭，再也扛不住这疯狂的换拳。富尔顿一记重勾拳擦过你的头颅——四周的光亮骤然熄灭。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14560
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_round3_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14565
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_a0297670:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你被击昏，输掉了这场比试。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14567
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_27d96cab:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}闻讯赶来的同伴帮你缓过神来，把你搀回帐篷。这一天剩下的时光你都在躺着度过：一边呻吟喘息，一边郁郁地回想比武中犯下的种种失误。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14579
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_65c65528:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}结果你以漂亮的击倒赢得胜利，在场观众掌声雷动、喝彩连连。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升15！{vspace=5}声望（伯爵）提升5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14581
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_fa657fce:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}承诺的赏金也很快如约而至。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}+55 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14587
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_33355085:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}三个回合的激烈较量过后，裁判判定你获胜。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升10！{vspace=5}声望（伯爵）提升1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14589
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_88403863:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}承诺的赏金很快如约而至。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}+55 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14595
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_4c9e0d80:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}三个回合的激烈较量过后，裁判判定富尔顿获胜。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14597
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_fc38f4a6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管落败，这场精彩的较量还是让你在同袍中声望见长。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（士兵）提升5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14600
translate chinese fight_club_fight1_result_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14608
translate chinese helping_a_friend_death_6da95851:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最终总攻的前一天，你从一位同伴口中听到了噩耗……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14610
translate chinese helping_a_friend_death_a5effdc0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}巴塞洛缪——医者们为他救治许久，终究还是没能把他从鬼门关拉回来。和许多重伤者一样，他去世了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14612
translate chinese helping_a_friend_death_00cc06e3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这消息立刻给你的整个世界蒙上阴影，心中充满苦涩与愤恨。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14614
translate chinese helping_a_friend_death_4b092bae:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}纷乱沉重的思绪中，最令人痛彻心扉的，是你本可以帮朋友一把、本可以救他一命……而你却没有尽到全力。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14616
translate chinese helping_a_friend_death_594e12c8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如今，他的血便沾在你的手上。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德降低10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14621
translate chinese helping_a_friend_death_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14627
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_1eaf7695:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最终总攻前几天，你意外地收到了好消息。多亏你的帮助和塞西莉亚的努力，巴塞洛缪终于挺了过来，正在康复之中。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14629
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_e999bff5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你前去探望朋友，见他精神焕发——甚至有些过头了。{vspace=5}谢过你的救命之恩后，巴塞洛缪声称，他已经等不及要为上次攻城时自己那丢人的“表现”一雪前耻。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14631
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_04d3660d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他说，尽管医者严令他近日不得有任何活动，但他已打定主意要溜出医疗帐篷，参加即将到来的这场大战。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14633
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14637
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_a57b2ed5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你借着自己在军中的威望，以及刚救了他一命的情分，劝住了巴塞洛缪这个鲁莽的念头，让他明白日后还有的是仗打、有的是功立。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14639
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_99450d90:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他虽不情愿，终究还是让了步，答应保重身体。临别时他祝你旗开得胜，并许诺会为你祈祷。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德提升5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14644
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_ba66e22f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你明知巴塞洛缪此举凶险，却还是没有出言劝阻。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14646
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_59b0331a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}连你自己也说不清为何如此。这一夜你辗转难眠，被愧疚反复啃噬。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:14657
translate chinese helping_a_friend_lives_88141a15:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}任务完成经验：+[temp_experience_number]"

