# game/script_dlc.rpy:15048
translate chinese nighty_knight_shot_miss_09d67904:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}注意到你那失手一箭的骑手，嘲弄地朝你挥了挥手，便不慌不忙地隐入营地之中。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:15050
translate chinese nighty_knight_shot_miss_4101d4ac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你恨恨地朝他背影啐了一口，一边低声咒骂，一边打道回府。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:15052
translate chinese nighty_knight_shot_miss_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:15057
translate chinese nighty_knight_shot_miss_ec4b0957:

    "{cps=50}你前往伯爵处禀报任务失败，他的脸色顿时比乌云还要阴沉。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:15059
translate chinese nighty_knight_shot_miss_dc434077:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他沉默地听完你关于狂风与难缠目标的辩解，只丢下几句生硬的话：你让所有人失望了。随后便把你赶了出去。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}声望（伯爵）降低10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:15064
translate chinese nighty_knight_shot_miss_76b2fe88_1:

