translate chinese st_lazarus_help_89877ba6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}多亏你的帮助，医院药物短缺的困境得以缓解，疫情不久便被遏制住了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德提升25！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）提升25！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:19606
translate chinese st_lazarus_help_2c1a7e88:

