# game/script_dlc.rpy:21403
translate chinese knightfall_intro_a657db3e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}前往埃兹贝尔特的路程令人精疲力竭。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳增加[player_stamina_max]！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21406
translate chinese knightfall_intro_e147eaf0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}行至半途，你决定稍作休整，躲进一片稀稀落落的绿荫里喘口气。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21408
translate chinese knightfall_intro_98a09c7a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你才刚放松下来，一条不知从哪儿冒出的蛇便咬了你一口，将毒液注入你的血脉。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}毒性上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21411
translate chinese knightfall_intro_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21416
translate chinese knightfall_intro_02865083:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}虽有种种波折，你还是顺利抵达了被围的埃兹贝尔特——这座城堡虽算坚固，却并非固若金汤。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21418
translate chinese knightfall_intro_6a4015d5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}即便有了你和你的队伍这支生力军，总督的人马仍不急于强攻，反而主张围而不攻、静观其变。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21420
translate chinese knightfall_intro_0d7c3db5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}照他们的说法，城中被困者早已饱受缺粮缺水之苦，再耗上一阵，兴许就能不战而胜。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21422
translate chinese knightfall_intro_e2ae17df:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在围城营地里干耗时间的图景让你提不起兴致，可凭着作战经验，你也承认这法子确有道理。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21424
translate chinese knightfall_intro_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21427
translate chinese knightfall_intro_d2b6a012:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不禁想起当年围困康布雷时，军士说过的一句话：{vspace=5}{i}“没脑子的人才去硬冲城门。”{/i}"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21429
translate chinese knightfall_intro_4056a795:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你深知这话的分量，可实在耗不起时日，便执意要求立刻强攻。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21431
translate chinese knightfall_intro_10b0b1b3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}总督的人同意即刻攻城——条件是必须由你的队伍打头阵，承担最大的风险。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21433
translate chinese knightfall_intro_e63bb028:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你别无选择。几个时辰之后，你像往日攻城时那样，扛着云梯冲向堡墙……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21436
translate chinese knightfall_intro_9e7b293e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}比起在毫无准备地强攻中丧命，你更愿意付出些时间——于是同意了继续围城。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}时间流逝：5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21439
translate chinese knightfall_intro_9c0c7a57:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此后的一周里，埃兹贝尔特的守军日渐衰弱，而你则汲取康布雷之战的教训，为攻城做着周密的准备。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:21441
translate chinese knightfall_intro_6b110ce0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一切准备就绪，你发起了攻城。"

