translate chinese el_mansur_scorpio_27443801:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第三天的行程平安无事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24475
translate chinese el_mansur_scorpio_1cfaabc4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}赶了很长一段路后，你寻到一小片绿荫，便停下来歇脚纳凉。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24477
translate chinese el_mansur_scorpio_4a8b567b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你刚寻了个舒坦的姿势，一只不知从何而来的蝎子就连蜇了你几下，休息就此泡汤。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力降低1！{vspace=5}毒性上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24482
translate chinese el_mansur_scorpio_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24490
translate chinese el_mansur_open_sky_5782e8e8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你们继续赶路。按地图所示，前方是一大片荒无人烟、连个歇脚宿营之处都没有的旷野。为尽快穿过这段路，你们一整天都泡在马背上。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24492
translate chinese el_mansur_open_sky_4f22f547:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你们的盘算落了空，暮色骤然降临，你们只得在荒漠正中央扎营过夜。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24494
translate chinese el_mansur_open_sky_1c15f37f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}夜里寒气袭人，你们险些冻毙，总算是凭着运气活了下来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24496
translate chinese el_mansur_open_sky_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24511
translate chinese el_mansur_open_sky_d626ab70:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值降低25！{vspace=5}生命力降低1！{vspace=5}全队成员生命值降低25！{vspace=5}全队成员生命力降低1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24515
translate chinese el_mansur_open_sky_f61a65fe:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值降低25！{vspace=5}生命力降低1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24519
translate chinese el_mansur_open_sky_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24527
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_3115c1d1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}经历了前一夜的恐惧，你宁愿付出任何代价，也不愿再露宿荒野。行至第五天傍晚，一座山洞映入眼帘——洞内宽敞避风，足以充当舒适的宿处。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24529
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_0dcb7af9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你毫不犹豫地停下，在此歇脚。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24531
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24550
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_0e46441b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可并非所有人都乐于接受这个安排。你们刚进洞，[ally!ti]便忽然陷入恐慌，坚称此地受了诅咒，必须立刻离开。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24552
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_c6ba1b32:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不想再在露天过夜，便命令他镇定下来，别再装神弄鬼。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24554
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_8ffb930a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可[ally!ti]拒不听从，反而下了最后通牒：要么大家一同离开，要么他便自行离队。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24556
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24560
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_58c8984b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的耐心消耗殆尽，勒令他严守军纪、服从命令。可[ally!ti]已完全失去理智，见你发作，竟拔出了武器……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24562
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24583
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24595
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_7559b597:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见[ally!ti]已彻底不可理喻，你认定放他自便才是最省事的法子。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24597
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_c7a628b2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}[ally!ti]离开了队伍。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24599
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24616
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24621
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_38b7b65a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可前一夜的后患很快卷土重来——你开始发起高烧。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24623
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_427696d9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若不立即服药，这场病会严重侵蚀你的身体……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24625
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24632
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_ff14a1d2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}药到病除，你与病魔擦肩而过。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}物品丢失——[medicine.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24634
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:24639
translate chinese el_mansur_cave_bc3a4d8f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}药到病除，你与病魔擦肩而过。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}物品丢失——[potent_medicine.name!ti]。"

