# game/script_dlc.rpy:25059
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_60e23d20:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第六天，你们在荒漠中与一小队迷路的欧洲战士不期而遇。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25061
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_4e00e331:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们形容枯槁、衣衫褴褛，正饱受干渴煎熬，苦苦哀求你们分些水喝。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25063
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25072
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_1110e59b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你把水分给了他们。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德提升20！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25076
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_6e7c7838:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们千恩万谢，随后继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25079
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25091
