    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25104
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_da6e58fc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你回绝了他们，说自己也没有余水可分。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25106
translate chinese el_mansur_crusaders_e5bf7c23:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可这些战士并不相信，声称既然如此，他们便要自己动手取所需之物。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25109
