# game/script_dlc.rpy:25621
translate chinese el_mansur_sandstorm_e25105ab:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第七天，一场骇人的沙暴袭来，天地间一片混沌，完全无法辨认方向。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25623
translate chinese el_mansur_sandstorm_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25636
translate chinese el_mansur_sandstorm_a14cb34d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}队伍试图抱作一团前行，可运气并不站在你们这边——[ally!ti]与队伍失散了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25638
translate chinese el_mansur_sandstorm_d3fa7308:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}待沙暴终于平息，[ally!ti]已遍寻不着。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25656
translate chinese el_mansur_sandstorm_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25661
translate chinese el_mansur_sandstorm_6fb8ed04:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你正寻觅避风之处，狂风却一次次把尖锐的沙粒甩在脸上，刺痛了你的双眼。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}眼睛受伤！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25668
translate chinese el_mansur_sandstorm_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25676
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_93f5dad6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第九天，你在地平线上望见一片小小的绿洲。终于可以歇歇脚、痛饮一番的念头，顿时填满了你的脑海。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25678
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25681
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_c4cf085d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定前往那片绿洲。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25683
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_94cfba8d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一路无惊无险地赶到那里，等待你的却是个不悦的意外：绿洲已被一小队撒拉森人占据，他们一见你们，立刻抄起了武器。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25685
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25696
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_4ff62a77:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}但你没有时间休息，只得继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25698
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_dbc82040:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}仿佛是对你的惩罚，仅仅几个时辰后，可怕的干渴便攫住了你……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:25700
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26105
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_fight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26184
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_postfight_08bf6203:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在绿洲歇息片刻，你终于缓过气来，恢复了几分气力。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳度下降！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26201
translate chinese el_mansur_oasis_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26211
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_9b884087:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第十天，太阳仿佛存心嘲弄你似的，晒得愈发毒辣。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26213
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26226
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_927d184a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你以坚韧的意志硬扛着酷热，可并非每个人都像你这般硬朗。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26228
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_d7dadd21:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}某一刻，[ally!ti]突然坠下马背，昏死过去。你急忙赶去施救，可无论你做什么，他始终没有醒来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26230
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_4d0c3ae2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}又过了片刻，他彻底没了呼吸。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26232
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26249
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_5f0f9bd3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你以坚韧的意志硬扛着酷热。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值降低10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26253
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_002af62f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}头顶的铁盔被晒得滚烫，某一刻你终于撑不住，眼前一黑，栽下马来。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值降低20！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26256
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_863ff702:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}缓过气来之后，你继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26259
translate chinese el_mansur_sunstrike_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26267
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_1c060673:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第十一天，你对照地图时判断失误，一脚踏进了流沙之中。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26269
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26282
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_d2cd7f08:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你侥幸脱身，可[ally!ti]陷得太深，任凭你拼力拖拽，他也再没能爬出来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26284
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_144f7a05:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就这样，你失去了最后一位同伴。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26286
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26303
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26306
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_08139c16:

    "{cps=50}你几乎陷到齐腰深，拼尽全力才死里逃生。奇迹般爬出这夺命的陷阱后，你累得几乎喘不上气。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳度上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26310
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_deda9f88:

    "{cps=50}你几乎陷到齐腰深，拼尽全力才死里逃生。奇迹般爬出这夺命的陷阱后，你因疲惫与虚脱而气喘吁吁。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量、敏捷、协调、耐力与活力降低2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26317
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26322
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_8081639b:

    "{cps=50}你几乎陷到齐腰深，为了保命，不得不狠心丢弃一部分随身装备。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26323
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26326
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_e481a175:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你失去了盾牌！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26340
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_7ef35f6a:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你失去了头盔！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26359
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_88a17817:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你失去了护腕！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26389
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_e971a9f9:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你失去了护喉甲！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26420
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_119f6b2f:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你失去了护腿！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26451
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_aecfd760:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你失去了胸甲！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26475
translate chinese el_mansur_quicksands_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26483
translate chinese el_mansur_mamluks_4d7cc19c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}第十三天，你撞见一支狼狈不堪的撒拉森队伍——看模样，他们刚刚从一场大麻烦中脱身。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:26485
translate chinese el_mansur_mamluks_584e3c96:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管个个精疲力竭，他们仍毫不迟疑地与你开战。"

