translate chinese lindisfarne_chief_monk_talk_feeb5cfc:

    "{cps=50}弗罗林刚从你的口袋流入修士们的腰包，这些主的仆人便立刻换了一副面孔，声称早已看出你是个有分量的人物，随即恭恭敬敬地把你领去见院长。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失50弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:29159
translate chinese lindisfarne_chief_monk_talk_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:29162
translate chinese lindisfarne_chief_monk_talk_0dc9d0b1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你倒不介意破费，可随身携带的金额不够，修士们又不肯少收。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}金钱不足！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:29164
translate chinese lindisfarne_chief_monk_talk_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:29168
translate chinese lindisfarne_chief_monk_talk_07782bcb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你无意掏钱，与修士们又争执了几分钟，明白这场谈话已彻底陷入僵局。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:29170
