# game/script_dlc.rpy:30395
translate chinese breakthrough_cowards_1_postfight_5a13d43f:

    "{cps=50}你毫不留情地收拾了这些懦夫，继续向温莎进发。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30397
translate chinese breakthrough_cowards_1_postfight_5940730c:

    "{cps=50}给了这些懦夫一个教训之后，你继续向温莎进发。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30398
translate chinese breakthrough_cowards_1_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30409
translate chinese breakthrough_2_59d93a4f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}抵达温莎时，映入眼帘的可不是什么令人欣慰的景象——整座城池已被敌人完全占领，几面叛军旗帜在虽然破旧却依然坚固的城防工事上方飘扬。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30411
translate chinese breakthrough_2_add9a711:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一见到你们出现，敌人立刻骚动起来，城墙上陆续冒出人影。不过人数并不多，恰好印证了这只是一支小部队的推断。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30413
translate chinese breakthrough_2_bef95b7f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}让你得出同样结论的，还有城头飘扬的旗帜中既不见坎特伯雷的私人旗号，也没有他那些老兵出战时常举的战旗。{vspace=5}很明显，眼前并非叛军主力。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30415
translate chinese breakthrough_2_cee175e7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}权衡着各种可行之策，你明白守城早已来不及，如今唯一的补救办法就是强攻温莎。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30417
translate chinese breakthrough_2_c4509d1a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}仅仅“强攻”二字，配上近在咫尺、高耸入云的城墙，便立刻让你想起那段被称作“康布雷围城”的数月梦魇……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30419
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30422
translate chinese breakthrough_2_1297e554:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你明白自己并无太多选择，于是作出了唯一的决断，下达了强攻的命令。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30424
translate chinese breakthrough_2_51fb9138:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}匆匆勘察过城池之后，他们将目标选定为南墙——那里最为破败，有些段落已明显倾斜，有的地方甚至半塌半颓。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30426
translate chinese breakthrough_2_fdedc2d2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你命众人下马，结成密集队形，在盾牌的掩护下向前推进。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30428
translate chinese breakthrough_2_0ff8b078:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}等你们进入射程，叛军立刻弓弩齐发。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30430
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30432
translate chinese breakthrough_2_990ec199:

    "{cps=50}你在前往温莎途中收拢的那几名士兵，被箭矢与弩矢射中，当场倒地毙命。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30433
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30448
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30449
translate chinese breakthrough_2_ab6f6e9d:

    "{cps=50}你手下有一个人受了伤。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}[attackchance!ti] 受了伤！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30451
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30453
translate chinese breakthrough_2_ec2ff7b6:

    "{cps=50}一支弩矢擦伤了你。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值降低10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30454
translate chinese breakthrough_2_647dcc1d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}叛军人数有限，无法组织起密集的射击，只能眼睁睁看着你们冲到墙下。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30456
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30458
translate chinese breakthrough_2_819bfe6f:

    "{cps=50}你翻过那段残破的城墙，冲进了城里……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30460
translate chinese breakthrough_2_51282c3b:

    "{cps=50}你费了九牛二虎之力才翻过那段残破的城墙，累得气喘吁吁，总算冲进了城里……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调——失败！{vspace=5}疲劳增加！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30463
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30472
translate chinese breakthrough_2_4e161fc6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不愿让自家兄弟白白冒险，你派那些半路收拢的士兵先去试探性进攻。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30474
translate chinese breakthrough_2_233c81c4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们结成密集队形，举盾掩护，向南墙那段半塌的缺口推进。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30476
translate chinese breakthrough_2_09936c70:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}等他们进入射程，叛军立刻弓弩齐发，几名士兵应声毙命。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30478
translate chinese breakthrough_2_43c69b72:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}士兵们总算摸到了墙根，与叛军交上了手，但刚有伤亡便立刻退了回来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30480
translate chinese breakthrough_2_58013ea8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}以你目前的兵力，不足以完全包围城池，眼下唯一能做的就是扎营城下，等待援军到来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30482
translate chinese breakthrough_2_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30487
translate chinese breakthrough_2_09184206:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}康布雷一役留下的心理创伤实在太过深重，任凭局势如何紧迫，你终究没能下决心下达强攻的命令。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30489
translate chinese breakthrough_2_58013ea8_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}以你目前的兵力，不足以完全包围城池，眼下唯一能做的就是扎营城下，等待援军到来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30491
translate chinese breakthrough_2_85084f69:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}北安普顿率领的生力军，直到黄昏才赶到。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:30493
