# game/script_dlc.rpy:33526
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_fail_13704bf6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回到伦敦后，你向北安普顿汇报了哈德利之行的结果。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33528
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_fail_96ab13d8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伯爵对这次失利大为不满，指出你打算武力闯入男爵府邸的决定显然是个错误。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（伯爵）减少15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33531
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_fail_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33544
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_91a06c99:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}哈德利城堡内部的景象同样不容乐观——这座本可容纳远更多人的城堡，如今显得空旷荒凉，即便还算不上半废弃，也无疑是一处正缓缓走向衰亡的所在。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33546
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_ce372a4a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你求见男爵被婉拒，取而代之的是被带去见宫廷医师——他把你当成了应男爵之召来到哈德利的众多游方医者之一：炼金术士、医生或巫医中的一员。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33548
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_ff0c98b0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他三言两语说明了情况：科尔切斯特愿出五千弗罗林，赏给任何能制出药物、战胜其领地瘟疫的人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33550
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_6ea5948b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这笔可观的赏金早已吸引来王国各地的众多能手，但至今无人能将之收入囊中。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33552
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_7576a1f1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而从眼下急剧恶化的形势来看，恐怕也很难有人做到了……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}任务已更新 - [hellish_trio_hadley.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33557
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_78a8891f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}接待你的宫廷医师问起你的进展……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33560
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33562
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33565
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_15a5d948:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}医师瞥了一眼你的解毒剂，嗤笑道：这东西怕是连伤风都治不好。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33569
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_15a5d948_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}医师瞥了一眼你的解毒剂，嗤笑道：这东西怕是连伤风都治不好。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33585
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_be90e08e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}医师饶有兴致地研究了你的解毒剂，同意先在一名新近染病的患者身上试药。出乎所有人意料，病人的病情竟然以肉眼可见的速度好转。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33587
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_cd6396e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}当晚，医师在你的协助下研读了解毒剂的配方，着手准备第一批大批量的药剂。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33589
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_913c1377:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}次日清晨，科尔切斯特男爵终于给了你期盼已久的单独接见，当面致谢并嘉奖于你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33591
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_d468cc83:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你趁此机会向他道明此来哈德利的真正目的，请求他在王位之争中支持爱德华王子。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33593
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_5eec06ea:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这番话令男爵勃然大怒，他愤然宣称，王室施加于他的羞辱，他永远不会原谅。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33595
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_269436e1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过片刻之后，他的怒火稍稍平息，男爵承认：虽然他绝不愿与王储站在同一阵营，但他确实欠你一份人情。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33597
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_13c42d27:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}况且无论论行事还是论地位，你都是个值得托付之人——他愿意将一部分兵力和资源交由你调遣。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33599
translate chinese hellish_trio_hadley_interaction_menu_417a2577:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}科尔切斯特男爵同意在战争中支持你！{vspace=5}获得5000弗罗林！{vspace=5}声望（伯爵）增加15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:33604
