# game/script_dlc.rpy:34701
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_bandits_postfight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34710
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_b6c65017:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管贵为侯爵的正式宅邸，奇彭纳姆城堡却规模不大，甚至比达特福德那座狩猎城堡还要小。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34712
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_6bbed930:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}策马靠近后，你得以把这地方看个仔细。不过四下里似乎也没什么好看的——城堡前的空地上散落着十来间小屋，农民们照常忙碌，城墙上有几名弩手向下张望，主堡的塔楼上飘着一面旗帜。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34714
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34717
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_5238e625:

    "{cps=50}在琼斯的陪同下，你策马穿过放下的吊桥，经过卫兵身边，进入了城堡内部。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34719
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_15dd72a2:

    "{cps=50}你骑马越过放下的吊桥，向卫兵报上姓名。听说你有事要见邓肯，他们便放你入内，引你走进城堡深处。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34721
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_41d15848:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}奇彭纳姆的新主人正在大厅里等你——他坐在一张长桌尽头的宝座上，那把椅子想必不久前还属于侯爵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34723
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_68116415:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你本以为会见到一个拦路劫道的强盗，眼前之人却让你颇感意外：他衣着整洁、面容清爽，身披丝绸锦缎，颈挂粗重的金链，指间缀满华贵的宝石戒指。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34725
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_3eb0b12f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若不是琼斯事先提醒，你几乎要把他当成货真价实的雷德克利夫侯爵本人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34727
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_2cc6981c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这种怪异的感觉更甚：他自称{i}邓肯·奇彭纳姆侯爵{/i}，并且一本正经地要求你用这个头衔称呼他。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34729
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_fde87c3f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}自报家门后，你简要说明来意，请这位{i}侯爵{/i}支持爱德华王子对抗叛军。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34731
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_e2b72171:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你说话时，邓肯身边的仆从往来不停，为他奉酒摇扇，信使则不时递上羊皮纸便笺，在他耳边低声禀报。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34733
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_3d3fe0ac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}有一刻你甚至觉得邓肯根本没在听，可你话音一落，他立刻抛出一个问题。{w}{vspace=5}与一小时前琼斯问过你的，一字不差。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34735
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_535d8c84:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那么他自己又能从中得到什么？"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34737
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_fe9c2cb8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你以为他要的无非是钱财，便向{i}侯爵{/i}许诺了一大笔弗罗林。然而他并未应允，只是摇了摇头。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34739
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_ee89021b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}邓肯说，他愿意支持爱德华王子，但前提是能得到相应的回报……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34741
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_d6957513:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他要求一个承诺：待爱德华登基后，以王室名义赦免邓肯手下所有人，并正式册封他为侯爵，爵位可传予子孙后代。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34743
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34747
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_09dcbd2d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与强盗做交易让你深感厌恶，但你不得不压下这份感受。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德降低50！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34750
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_023ad30c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你转念一想，这些狂妄的要求其实也算不得多过分，便以王子的名义应允了他。而{i}邓肯·奇彭纳姆侯爵{/i}也承诺，将助你与叛军作战。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34752
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_85232b1c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回到伦敦后，你向北安普顿与王子汇报了此行的结果。与昨日还打家劫舍的强盗打交道，两人都没什么兴致，但他们还是赞许了你的做法——如今不是挑肥拣瘦的时候，容不得在选择盟友上挑剔。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34754
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_515610c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}{i}邓肯·奇彭纳姆侯爵{/i}同意在战争中支持你！{vspace=5}你可以在奇彭纳姆招募人手！{vspace=5}声望（伯爵）增加15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34762
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34768
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_88141a15:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}任务完成经验：+[temp_experience_number]"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34770
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34776
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_267af9b3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与强盗做交易本身已让你兴致全无，他这些狂妄的要求更是让你厌恶至极。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34778
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34780
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_bbd4ffac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你眼前仿佛又浮现出艾丽莎的身影，她讲述着邓肯及其手下在格林威治犯下的种种暴行……还提醒你：一旦哪个农民胆敢对领主或骑士动手而逍遥法外，他迟早会对所有人举起屠刀。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34782
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_c614ae83:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你回答邓肯：他的效劳顶多换来黄金，但休想指望一个出身农民的匪首杀了侯爵、占了领地还能安然无事。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德增加15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34785
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_3c5b6dda:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你话音未落，邓肯原本平静淡漠的眼神里，浮现出毫不掩饰的轻蔑。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34787
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_8d8f8e98:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他沉默片刻，摊开双手说道：既然你只把他当强盗，那他就用强盗的规矩来对待你。{vspace=5}说不定还能让你长点记性。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34789
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_83026f04:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}至少，该尊重一下你此刻做客的这家的主人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34791
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_95c995c4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}说罢，邓肯便命令手下解决掉你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34793
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_3900eafd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你试图夺路而逃，卫兵却立刻从四面八方围拢上来，封死了所有退路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34795
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_ea785caa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}邓肯的人卸下你的武器，将你手脚捆缚，拖进附近的小树林，随手扔在地上。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}装备尽失！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34797
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:34999
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_f5f39b1e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}其中一人俯身将匕首抵上你的喉咙，你明白接下来会发生什么。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35001
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35004
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_dc140213:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你开口求饶。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德降低25！{vspace=5}威望降低1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35016
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35018
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_bba4acaa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}幸运的是，被派来处置你的邓肯手下里也有琼斯。他说服同伴留下你的性命，改为索要赎金。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35020
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_85f1c0e0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}赎金定为两千五百弗罗林。放你走之前，琼斯逼你立誓，日后定会带着这笔钱回来。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已接取 - [ransom.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35024
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_1f87da72:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回到伦敦后，你向北安普顿汇报了此行的结果。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35026
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_658f6f62:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伯爵对毫无收获十分不满，可一听说侯爵丧命于强盗之手，他的怒火便迅速转为忧虑。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35028
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_c48a34f2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}至于奇彭纳姆，北安普顿下令暂且搁置，专心对付坎特伯雷。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35030
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35037
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_786aa0d1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而这不是什么皆大欢喜的童话，匕首割开了你的喉咙。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}喉咙被割开！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35041
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_05a90dcd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼前一片漆黑，你迎来了死亡。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35043
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35047
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_64496f52:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}纵然明白自己的生命即将终结，你仍不肯开口求饶……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德增加25！{vspace=5}威望增加1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35051
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_549d096a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……你带着尊严迎接死亡。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}喉咙被割开！"

