# game/script_dlc.rpy:35075
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_ecd5f6de:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管伤势骇人、血流不止，你竟奇迹般地没有当场毙命，在没有医治的情况下又撑了大约一个时辰——直到一群进林拾柴的农民发现了你半死不活的身躯。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35077
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_47bfae9c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们为你做了简单的急救，又把你藏在一户人家中休养了几天，直到你恢复得足以独自返回伦敦。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35079
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_d14cd0c4_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35081
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_6633f604:

    nvl clear
    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回到首都后，你向北安普顿汇报了此行的结果。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35086
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_85fe6da6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}伯爵对毫无进展甚为不满，可一见到你归来时的那副模样，怒火便迅速转为关切。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35088
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_c48a34f2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}至于奇彭纳姆，北安普顿下令暂且搁置，专心对付坎特伯雷。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35090
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_6adaf8bd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}所有属性降低2！{vspace=5}耗时：3。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35099
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_duncan_death_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35114
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_d299896d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回想艾丽莎交给你的任务，你仔细回忆起了那趟奇彭纳姆之行。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35116
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_19df70e9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}侯爵的宅邸是一座中等规模的城堡——虽有防御工事，但远算不上固若金汤的要塞。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35118
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_9dea06ea:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}强攻此城似乎并非难事，尤其是守军人数不多或素质平平的情况下。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35120
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_d383e33e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可若情形相反，城堡守备森严，那闪电强攻便无从谈起。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35122
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_7f1d12ed:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在记忆中搜寻着：城墙与塔楼上的弩手，以及城门口那些看上去尚能一战的卫兵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35124
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_93c667f2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你盘算一番，认定只要麾下有五十名左右熟悉攻城的战士，凭这种守备水平，一轮迅猛的正面强攻足以将其拿下。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35126
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_2eb90e7d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最后浮上心头的另一个选择，是潜入城内。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35128
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_f5d29df7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若能收买城堡里某个愿意趁夜色为你打开侧门、放你入城的人，此事便可以用极小的代价解决。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35130
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35132
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_3635d957:

    "{cps=50}唯一的难处，在于找出那位对邓肯怀恨在心、神秘莫测的奇彭纳姆内应……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35133
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35135
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_a2f73613:

    "{cps=50}不过无论你作何选择，只要温莎还握在坎特伯雷的人手中，从城下抽调兵力——哪怕只是寥寥数人——都不是什么好主意。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35136
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_7517d746:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因此，在攻取一座要塞之前，你得先解决另一座……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35138
translate chinese hellish_trio_chippenham_hire_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

