    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35158
translate chinese chippenham_overthrow_menu_49525f21:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}在对奇彭纳姆发起进攻前，你需要先对温莎成功发动三次进攻……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35160
translate chinese chippenham_overthrow_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35166
translate chinese chippenham_overthrow_menu_8057a95e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定以一场干脆利落的正面强攻夺取奇彭纳姆。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35168
translate chinese chippenham_overthrow_menu_af54c783:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你派主力佯攻牵制，待守军与之交战后，亲率一小队人马带着唯一一架云梯，从城堡另一侧直扑而去……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35170
translate chinese chippenham_overthrow_menu_290bec5d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这个并不复杂的计策奏效了，你毫无阻碍地攀上城墙，打了留守该侧的几名邓肯手下个措手不及。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35172
translate chinese chippenham_overthrow_menu_6d9a79a7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你眼下要做的，就是赶在他们唤来援兵之前将其解决……"

