# game/script_dlc.rpy:35316
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_bcfd4cc5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}对于你提议他参与温莎的战事，琼斯起初兴致寥寥……{w}{vspace=5}你许诺的丰厚报酬固然让他心动，但真要上战场这件事，实在提不起他的劲头。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35318
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35321
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_c7d23e38:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可当你让他明白，这可不是一般的“好赚”，而是“非常非常好赚”——他立刻换了副面孔。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35324
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35327
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_0f1dc43d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可当你许下承诺，除了军饷之外，战后还能让他痛快地洗劫一番城池——他立刻变了脸色。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德降低10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35331
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35334
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_f41a91c6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}琼斯先是声明，自己身为头目不会亲自冲锋陷阵，随后接受了你的提议。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}你可以在奇彭纳姆雇佣琼斯及其手下。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35336
