# game/script_dlc.rpy:35353
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_036eb61e:

    "{cps=50}想起琼斯此前流露过对邓肯的不满，你小心翼翼地把话题引向他：若是那位新侯爵哪天“消失”，换一位更……顺眼的人上位，他作何感想。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35354
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_0c9717fe:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}深谙权谋机变的琼斯很快便猜到你的用意，让你不必绕弯子，直接开个实打实的价码。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35356
translate chinese ransom_intro_menu_7ad72373:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你并未透露艾丽莎所拟计划中的机密细节，只是向他交代了大致安排。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35358
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35360
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_96b61072:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}琼斯表示愿意协助你除掉邓肯——他会暗中放你与你的队伍进入城堡，并负责解决部分守卫，好让你专心对付侯爵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35362
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_3c650648:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他的开价是五千弗罗林，此外还要求在即将继任的侯爵宫廷里谋一个俸禄优厚的职位。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35364
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35368
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_879bf77b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你接受了他的条件，将五千弗罗林交到他手中。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失5000弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35371
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_b21d0734:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}双方握手为定，敲定了突袭的细节。"

