# game/script_dlc.rpy:35395
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_d0e5f1d0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}琼斯耸了耸肩，说倘若你改了主意，随时欢迎再来……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35397
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_8202ace1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}至于他这边，会先把城堡的守卫增加一倍，并告知邓肯：据传有人正图谋刺杀他。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}城堡守卫加强！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35400
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35405
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_406948ee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你如约交出了那笔钱。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失2500弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35407
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_b7051a6f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}履行完承诺，你正要告辞离去，琼斯却忽然推心置腹地说，他其实并不怎么满意给邓肯卖命……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35409
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_c2f35fa2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……而且他相当乐意换个东家，何况还不是单枪匹马——他手下有十来号弟兄，个个是亡命之徒与冒险之徒。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35411
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_35bf3dc6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你问起他不满的缘由，琼斯答道：尽管赶走老侯爵、夺取城堡都已办成，可邓肯的追随者们却一个也没等到许诺的赏赐——裂痕便由此而生。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35413
translate chinese bribe_jones_quickjump_260e5901:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因此，当初纯粹冲着发财机会投奔他的人们如今满腹怨言，乐得另寻一位新“东家”。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:35415
