# game/script_dlc.rpy:36445
translate chinese watchmen_intro_250c5501:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}动身之前，你忽然想起：自抵达约克以来，自己连一顿正经饭都还没吃过。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36447
translate chinese watchmen_intro_561ac974:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}思来想去，你决定还是再去莉娜那里看看。{vspace=5}她大方地招待你吃了顿自家做的饭，味道竟出乎意料地可口。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力增加1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36449
translate chinese watchmen_intro_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36454
translate chinese watchmen_intro_3e76161d:

    "{cps=50}用餐时，莉娜自然不会放过机会，向你打听面见市长的情形……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36456
translate chinese watchmen_intro_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36464
translate chinese watchmen_intro_continued_2d69bdcc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}谁也不愿冒雨赶路，但职责驱使你前行，你顶着恶劣的天气动身北上。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36466
translate chinese watchmen_intro_continued_7c9df6d9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}凭借市长手下交给你的地图，赶了约莫三个小时的路，你来到了第一座前哨。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36468
translate chinese watchmen_intro_continued_b22dcd76:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}准确地说，是来到了它本该矗立的地方。而现实是，你眼前只有几道破败的防御工事——里里外外空无一人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36470
translate chinese watchmen_intro_continued_d6a20aa6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}匆匆查看过这座被弃置的工事后，你继续赶往下一座前哨。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36472
translate chinese watchmen_intro_continued_27e6448f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}望见工事上方升起的炊烟，你精神一振。策马靠近后，果然见到工事旁有一小队持械之人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36474
translate chinese watchmen_intro_continued_2296c904:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而这份相逢的欣喜并未持续多久——你刚报出名号，他们便立刻拔出了武器。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:36476
translate chinese watchmen_intro_continued_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

