# game/script_dlc.rpy:48457
translate chinese governor_of_damietta_talk_eb75b315:

    "{cps=50}你到总督处打听雷诺的消息，他却说手下的人还在研读文书。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48458
translate chinese governor_of_damietta_talk_bf93bf69:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你不悦，他宽慰道：过去他也帮人办过类似的查访，这种事向来旷日持久。若想熬过这段等待，最好还是先接受现实——你怕是要在达米埃塔长住了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48460
translate chinese governor_of_damietta_talk_56152c30:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为此，他提议你暂且正式入他麾下效力，既能领足饷银，条件也颇为优渥。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48462
translate chinese governor_items_received_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48465
translate chinese governor_of_damietta_talk_adae34d0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你答应了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48467
translate chinese governor_of_damietta_talk_fbe5fad2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你领到了薪饷，吃穿用度也有了着落。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}获得150弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48470
translate chinese governor_of_damietta_talk_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48475
translate chinese governor_items_received_c47698ba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}既已正式为他效力，总督又交给你一桩差事：处置城中另一处乱源。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48477
translate chinese governor_items_received_bc76cd80:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此人是一名意大利游方吟游诗人，前些时候自佛罗伦萨来到达米埃塔，近来常编唱些下流小调，挖苦总督及其施政。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48479
translate chinese governor_items_received_d2aadfbb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}总督的手下已数次向他提出决斗，可这该死的滑头剑术了得，每一场都以对手的惨败收场。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加 - [politics_101.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48482
translate chinese governor_items_received_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48486
translate chinese governor_items_received_4401d32b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}遭到你的拒绝，总督只是摊了摊手：既然如此，你除了等待别无他法。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48490
translate chinese governor_items_received_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48499
translate chinese governor_items_received_ab039f88:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你再次登门打听雷诺的消息，总督欣喜地告知：事情总算有了进展。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48501
translate chinese governor_items_received_48eed179:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}起初你也精神一振，可很快便发现，高兴得未免太早。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48503
translate chinese governor_items_received_17ea9bca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}骑士团的卷宗中查到一条记录：雷诺·德·沙蒂永确实隶属德·莫莱伯爵麾下，曾随部驻扎于埃兹贝尔特要塞。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48505
translate chinese governor_items_received_cf311b89:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}记录还提到雷诺曾患病，先是在达米埃塔城中的一所医务所就医，之后转往要塞内疗养。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48507
translate chinese governor_items_received_065e6624:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}卷宗中没有他的死讯，这意味着他多半已然痊愈、重归行伍。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48509
translate chinese governor_items_received_84026e3c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}至于德·莫莱伯爵的部曲，卷宗对其战事活动记载寥寥，在出征埃尔曼苏尔之前，只有一条相关记录。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48511
translate chinese governor_items_received_0a5b78db:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那条记录称，德·莫莱的一队人马在法拉斯库尔中了埋伏，多人被俘。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48513
translate chinese governor_items_received_b146a6d2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管形势看似黯淡，总督思忖之后认为，雷诺被俘这一假设颇具可能，值得追查。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48515
translate chinese governor_items_received_373c081b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据他说，双方将士被俘本是常事，俘虏之中甚至不乏身份显赫的人物。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48517
translate chinese governor_items_received_b2e65146:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为处理这类事宜，达米埃塔总督府与撒拉森人保持着经常性的联络，寻回并营救一名俘虏——尤其是出身贵胄者——并非难事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48519
translate chinese governor_items_received_c256b855:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而赎人的过程往往漫长而棘手——想加快进度，只有一个办法。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48521
translate chinese governor_items_received_b2cae5fe:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}将赎买变成交换。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48523
translate chinese governor_items_received_30cdc59c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你已隐约猜到总督的用意，便问他需要绑架何人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48525
translate chinese governor_items_received_13138064:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你一点就透，他喜形于色：此人名叫拜巴尔斯，是个中等势力的马穆鲁克领主，掌控着达米埃塔周边的商路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48527
translate chinese governor_items_received_d773b505:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}拜巴尔斯位高权重，断然不肯甘当阶下囚，他那四通八达的人脉，对寻找雷诺将大有助益。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加 - [abduction.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48531
translate chinese governor_items_received_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48536
translate chinese governor_items_received_2272b909:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你到总督处打听雷诺的消息，却依然一无所获。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48538
translate chinese governor_items_received_e9774b37:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他以谨慎的口吻暗示：恐怕未必能找到他。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48540
translate chinese governor_items_received_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48545
translate chinese governor_items_received_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48547
translate chinese governor_items_received_c3549b59:

    "{cps=50}你到总督处打听雷诺的消息，他却说目前仍无新讯，还需再等……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48549
translate chinese governor_items_received_7f47e586:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你和总督无话可谈……"

