translate chinese governor_items_received_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48562
translate chinese vettori_talk_4bc12e6e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}正如军士所言，你毫不费力便在桑德兰伯爵的人马里认出了韦托里——他那典型的地中海相貌格外醒目。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48564
translate chinese vettori_explains_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48567
translate chinese vettori_talk_ccb6972b:

    "{cps=50}凭着你响亮的名声，你们很快便谈拢了，韦托里答应出手相助。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望、声望（士兵）——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48568
translate chinese vettori_explains_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48570
translate chinese vettori_explains_6d116072:

    "{cps=50}按这位意大利人的说法，用寻常弩弓射出那样一箭颇有难度，少不得要动些巧思。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48571
translate chinese vettori_explains_99625c3a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}大部分准备工夫由他包揽，你只需设法弄来两样东西：一副弩机的扳机，以及一根结实强劲的弩弦。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48573
translate chinese vettori_explains_55dae49a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}当你追问这些东西该去哪里找时，韦托里只是摊了摊手——那就不是他操心的事了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48575
translate chinese vettori_explains_11bf9de9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过他又补了一句：实在不行，总能拿手头的材料凑合做一个，或者从构造相近的其他弩上拆下零件来用。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48577
translate chinese vettori_explains_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48580
translate chinese vettori_explains_d11444ba:

    "{cps=50}由于你名声不佳，韦托里对你满怀戒备，对你的请求也提不起什么兴致。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}}威望、声望（士兵）——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48581
translate chinese vettori_explains_a69202bf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}最终他还是答应帮忙，但前提是你得先替他办件事。{vspace=5}比如，给他弄一双新鞋——他那双前几天刚磨穿了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48583
translate chinese vettori_explains_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48584
translate chinese vettori_explains_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48591
translate chinese vettori_explains_82aaf8a5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在你为他弄来一双新鞋之前，韦托里可没打算帮你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48594
translate chinese vettori_explains_66550b8c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}韦托里告知：弩已改制完毕，他随时可以随你前往猎鹰塔。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:48597
translate chinese vettori_explains_d80d7046:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}韦托里正等着你弄来改造远程弩所需的那几样部件。"

