translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50756
translate chinese tutorial2_0619d19b:

    nvl clear
    "想了解各招式及其特性的详情，可将光标移到招式名称下方的图标上。"

