# game/script_dlc.rpy:50780
translate chinese tutorial2_2376fbb6:

    nvl clear
    "对防守方而言，当前的体力同样是至关重要的指标——体力越充足，闪避攻击的概率就越高。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50782
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50784
translate chinese tutorial2_43f2fe8e:

    "佯攻。{vspace=5}此按钮负责用主武器施展佯攻。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50788
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50790
translate chinese tutorial2_bd2e8178:

    "佯攻是一种虚晃招式，旨在引开对手注意、扰乱其心神。战斗中可用佯攻削弱对手——成功施展后，会削减敌人的体力，并施加\"致盲\"效果。\"致盲\"持续一回合，降低其攻击命中率。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50796
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50798
translate chinese tutorial2_c13e5843:

    nvl clear
    "佯攻能否奏效，取决于你的敏捷、武器技能与武器长度，以及对手的相应属性。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50800
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_10:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50802
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50804
translate chinese tutorial2_34baef7a:

    "姿态。{vspace=5}此按钮负责切换姿态。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50808
translate chinese tutorial2_4bde1ec7:

    nvl clear
    "玩家共有三种姿态可选——进攻、防御与均衡。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50810
translate chinese tutorial2_8a0b4a4d:

    nvl clear
    "进攻姿态会为近战攻击动作提供加成，但会降低闪避敌袭、用盾格挡的几率。{vspace=5}此姿态加成的多寡取决于武器技能属性。{vspace=5}进攻姿态最易受敌方攻击与佯攻所制。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50812
translate chinese tutorial2_c050fd4f:

    nvl clear
    "防御姿态会提升闪避敌袭与用盾格挡的几率，但会削弱攻击动作的成功率。{vspace=5}此姿态加成的多寡取决于敏捷属性。{vspace=5}与进攻姿态相比，防御姿态对佯攻有稍强的抵御能力。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50814
translate chinese tutorial2_01d38331:

    nvl clear
    "均衡姿态是二者之间的折中之选。此姿态在攻防两端既不提供加成，也不施加惩罚。{vspace=5}均衡姿态对敌方佯攻的抵御最为周全。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50816
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_12:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50818
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_13:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50820
translate chinese tutorial2_9fbcb17b:

    "休息。{vspace=5}此按钮负责恢复体力。休息的效率与恢复量取决于角色的协调属性。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50824
translate chinese tutorial2_76b2fe88_14:

