translate chinese tutorial_shield_1f85185c:

    nvl clear
    "盾牌。{vspace=5}此按钮负责使用盾牌（若已装备）。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50891
translate chinese tutorial_shield_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50893
translate chinese tutorial_shield_7c81943f:

    nvl clear
    "盾击的原理与佯攻相仿，只是其成败不取决于敏捷，而取决于力量。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50895
translate chinese tutorial_shield_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:50902
translate chinese tutorial_shield_132a471e:

    "成功的盾击可对对手施加\"眩晕\"效果，迫使其跳过下一回合。{vspace=5}命中眩晕目标的机会大增；此外，被眩晕者无法举盾格挡。"

