translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51002
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_bbf25bf7:

    "疲劳。{vspace=5}任何主动行动都会提高角色的疲劳值。疲劳的增长量等同于该行动消耗的体力——譬如角色发动一次消耗 10 点体力的攻击，其疲劳值也会相应增加 10。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51020
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51022
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_3739a20f:

    nvl clear
    "从一级疲劳升至下一级所需的疲劳值，恰好等同于你的体力总量。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51024
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_2c6dafdd:

    nvl clear
    "第一级疲劳（\"神清气爽\"）对角色行动毫无影响；但此后每升一级，惩罚便愈发沉重，所有攻防行动的效率都会下降。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51026
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_68d2bf7f:

    nvl clear
    "切记，过度的身体透支足以抵消装备与技艺上的巨大优势。一个疲惫得步履蹒跚之人，在精力充沛的对手面前难以为继。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51028
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51030
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_59039abe:

    "休息。{vspace=5}此按钮负责在战斗中降低疲劳等级。角色将消耗一回合来缓解部分疲劳。缓解的量取决于耐力，也可借助各种道具加以提升。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51034
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51036
translate chinese tutorial_fatigue_mini_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

