    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51079
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_de4d01b3:

    "伤势。{vspace=5}你与对手可以攻击彼此身体的不同部位，各部位的伤害倍率、护甲程度（依所穿装备而定）以及可能造成的伤势均不相同。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51115
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51117
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51119
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_d565b67e:

    "譬如，击中四肢可能造成腿骨骨折或手臂肌肉损伤，从而分别降低敏捷或武器技能。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51128
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51130
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51132
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_143ca242:

    "每种伤势带来的负面后果之轻重，取决于攻击者的力量。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51138
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51140
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_03a55d94:

    nvl clear
    "请注意，对玩家而言，多数伤势在营地里得到治愈之前会持续生效。若战间不及时治疗，伤势可能永久化，由此损失的属性将一去不返。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51142
translate chinese tutorial_injuries_mini_76b2fe88_6:

