# game/script_dlc.rpy:51249
translate chinese hunt_1_0e0eb7bd:

    "{cps=50}你离开巴黎，前往附近的森林，一来打打猎，二来探探风声。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51251
translate chinese hunt_1_9005432e:

    "{cps=50}为了补充给养，你离开营地，钻进附近的森林，迎向未知与冒险。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51252
translate chinese hunt_1_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51312
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51315
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_e8c5e8a4:

    "{cps=50}此番出行的主要目标是各类可用的草药与植物——它们能充当炼金药剂的材料；当然，若机会合适，你也不介意打点野味。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51316
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_69d9a10d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}寻摸了一阵之后，你来到密林深处，在那里发现了一头鹿。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51318
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51366
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_7fc778d2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如此猎物岂能放过，你当即伸手去取弩。那头鹿似乎也嗅到了什么，警觉地转动着脑袋张望。可它并没有急着逃走——这便给了你可乘之机。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51368
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51372
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_f91b13c0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你一发弩箭正中要害，鹿应声倒地。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}弩术检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51375
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_dfe88ae8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你收获的猎物有鹿皮，还有可以拿去卖钱的肉。这无疑给先前采到的草药添上了一笔不错的进项。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51377
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51381
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_c9f8ee42:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你射出弩箭，却落了空。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}弩术检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51383
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_93a1382b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}受惊的鹿转眼便逃得无影无踪，留你两手空空。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51385
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_106e1adf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如今你所能指望的，也只有采到的那点草药了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51387
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51391
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_d36fbb55:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管这是大发一笔的好机会，你还是决定不向那头威仪堂堂的野兽放箭，任它离去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51393
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51398
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51400
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_91c81e27:

    "{cps=50}你当即伸手去取弩，可把它端到手里，却懊恼地发现第一格弹巢还没装填。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51401
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_6a655140:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就在你手忙脚乱地摆弄机械弹鼓、小心翼翼地转动它的当口，那头鹿早已安然消失在密林深处。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51404
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_92a97a56:

    "{cps=50}你当即伸手去取弩，可把它端到手里，却懊恼地发现弩还未上弦。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51405
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_f1bd9080:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就在你与紧绷的弓弦和弩箭较劲的当口，那头鹿早已安然消失在密林深处。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51407
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_fb3b5a02:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你所能指望的，也只有采到的那点草药了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51409
translate chinese hunt_1_deer_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51414
translate chinese hunt_1_hunters_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51416
translate chinese hunt_1_hunters_9c27ed2f:

    "{cps=50}你在林中穿行时，撞上了一群本地的猎人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51417
translate chinese hunt_1_hunters_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51423
translate chinese hunt_1_hunters_da539883:

    "{cps=50}他们态度友善，还趁共同狩猎之机，传授了你几招弩术的诀窍。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运检定通过！{vspace=5}弩术技能+1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51426
translate chinese hunt_1_hunters_ef962f85:

    "{cps=50}他们态度算不上友善，请你离开他们的猎场。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}幸运检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51427
translate chinese hunt_1_hunters_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51433
translate chinese hunt_1_lost_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51435
translate chinese hunt_1_lost_dcd8f8cc:

    "{cps=50}你在林中穿行，不知不觉间越走越深，很快便意识到自己迷了路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51436
translate chinese hunt_1_lost_d3dc9594:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在荒野里好一番转悠，你总算摸回了林间大道，不过也耽搁了不少时辰。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51438
translate chinese hunt_1_lost_f90c1a3e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}聊以自慰的是，这一路走来，你终究还是采到了一些有用的草药。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51441
translate chinese hunt_1_lost_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51446
translate chinese hunt_1_knight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51448
translate chinese hunt_1_knight_291a1113:

    "{cps=50}在密林中兜转了一阵，你意外地闯入一片开阔的林间空地。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51449
translate chinese hunt_1_knight_d212fec2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这里留着多年前一场大战的痕迹。{w}脚下草丛里散落着兵器与甲胄的碎片，可惜大多已不堪再用。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51451
translate chinese hunt_1_knight_0ed6177a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}定睛细看，你发现了一具贵族骑士的遗骸，其装备保存得要好得多。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51453
translate chinese hunt_1_knight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51458
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_0e933b4c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你沿着密林深处一条窄径前行，忽见一座形制古怪的异教圣所——粗粝的石砌祭坛上刻着模糊的纹样，是早已消逝年代里被遗忘的旧神残影。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51460
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_ab7bc1c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}此地透着一种奇异的气氛。你屏息凝神，想要辨清自己此刻的所感——是惶惑，还是安宁。{w}可终究得不出答案。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51462
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_3d7cb2e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}视线落到祭坛基座下，你瞧见了几捧钱币——显然是有人留在这里献给旧神的祭品。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51464
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_a05a6a97:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}或许你也该舍出一两枚钱币，可是……同这样的存在打交道，真的值得吗？"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51466
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51470
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51472
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_cb2fd5f4:

    "{cps=50}你从口袋里摸出 5 弗罗林，放在基座上。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}-5 弗罗林！{vspace=5}美德-15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51475
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_0fa2285c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}就在你俯身放钱的那一刻，眼角瞥见祭坛旁的高草里有什么东西闪着微光。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51477
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51481
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_c98a8c68:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你也决定在祭坛前留下几枚弗罗林，便爽快地把口袋里那点零碎尽数掏了出来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51483
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_d71cabc6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你将钱币放在基座上……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}-[player_gold] 弗罗林！{vspace=5}美德-15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51485
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_e5b2cbe3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……然而什么也没有发生。{w}正如本可以预料到的那样。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51487
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_e07bb9c2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你也只得回去继续采草药。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51489
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51493
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_1145188b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你同样想在祭坛前留下几枚钱币，可惜口袋里空空如也……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51495
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_e07bb9c2_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你也只得回去继续采草药。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51497
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51501
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_5abf92f8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不愿与这样的力量纠缠，转身朝另一侧走去，回去继续采草药。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51503
translate chinese hunt_1_pagan_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51508
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_565bf583:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一程，你来到了一座村庄附近的林地。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51510
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_15f35874:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在那里，你遇到了一位乡野间的采药妇。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51512
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51515
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_5b5f8fd0:

    "{cps=50}起初，妇人十分戒备，可看清你是个体面人之后，便和善了许多。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51516
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_3ba8208c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}她帮你采了满满一抱有用的草药，甚至还将几个配方慷慨相授。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}制作技能提升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51521
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51523
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_aa436a9d:

    "{cps=50}这些配方你其实早已烂熟于心，只是没有说破罢了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51524
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51528
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_04fb674d:

    "{cps=50}看你的模样，显然全然没能赢得她的信任——一见你便匆匆离去，只留你独自采药。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51529
translate chinese hunt_1_herbwoman_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51534
translate chinese hunt_1_monk_f09170a6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你沿着密林深处一条窄径前行，不期然与一位云游僧人不期而遇。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51536
translate chinese hunt_1_monk_7846c92a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}神父为你祝祷，却也不忘告诫你莫要滥用暴力、妄染无辜之血。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51539
translate chinese hunt_1_monk_83a649cb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}言毕，他便继续赶路去了，留你独自采药。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51541
translate chinese hunt_1_monk_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51546
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_0dfd92dc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}沿着一条乡间土路走着，你不期然来到湖畔一家小小的酒馆。好客的店家邀你歇上一两个小时，饱餐一顿，只收 10 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51551
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_08a250c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你应承下来，接下来的两个时辰便在店家的款待中度过。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失 10 弗罗林。{vspace=5}时间流逝：1。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51555
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_2477f8fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}店家备下的饭菜出乎意料地可口，吃罢浑身又有了力气。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力提升2点！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51558
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51562
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_86e25433:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不愿浪费时间，你客气地谢绝了，继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51564
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51568
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_b7dee70f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可惜你口袋里分文全无，只得客气地谢绝，继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51570
translate chinese hunt_1_tavern_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51575
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_fed741a7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}前几日大雨过后，附近的道路大多成了一片烂泥，连双马驾辕的大车都举步维艰。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51577
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_5bb9c8a8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因此，当你在林边瞧见一辆深深陷在泥里、仅由一匹瘦马牵引的小货车时，你丝毫不觉意外。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51579
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_ab7a116a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一见你，货车主人便急忙迎上来，诚恳地请你帮他脱困，一道把车子从泥里推出来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51581
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51584
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_c1923a0c:

    "{cps=50}见死不救，哪怕是对素不相识之人，也不是你的行事风格。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+3！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51586
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_7bfee4cc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你往掌心啐了口唾沫，同那汉子一道抵住车尾，合力想把车子推出泥沼。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51589
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_beb6177a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}凭着你惊人的力量，货车终究被推了出来——虽然费了不少功夫。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51591
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_db79d44c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}满心欢喜的车主不住地道谢。他自称是本地的酿酒匠，作为酬谢，赠你两瓶自酿的艾尔，盼着这能抵得上你的援手与耽搁的工夫。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51596
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_b06fcf0c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管使出了浑身力气，你的力量终归不济，围着货车忙活几个时辰，也没能将它挪动分毫。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51598
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_00801678:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那位倒霉的车主谢过你的援手，解下马匹，骑马进村搬救兵去了。你则继续赶路，回去采草药。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51602
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_eee48267:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过你另有打算，不打算为别人的请求耗费时间——尤其报酬还虚无缥缈。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51605
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_20355bca:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你回绝了那位陌生人，回去继续采草药。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51607
translate chinese hunt_1_carriage_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51612
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_c7b30cc6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}采药途中，你蓦然瞥见一条毒蛇盘踞在一块大石上。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51614
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_9ceac8a9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}即便你对博物所知寥寥，也知晓此蛇的剧毒极为猛烈——炼金时兴许正用得着。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51616
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_986cfd25:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可为了它冒险，值得吗？"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51618
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51622
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_e31f9b29:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为了这珍贵的毒液，你甘愿冒这个险，蹑手蹑脚地向蛇靠近……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51628
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_7227e549:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}凭着敏捷的身手，你的计划得逞——潜行至一臂之距，一击结果了毒蛇。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51630
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_ab08ec97:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如今，除了有用的草药，你还额外收获了一份宝贵的蛇毒。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51634
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_9ddb5c20:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你的敏捷还不足以支撑这样的举动。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷检定失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51636
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_94ae1090:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你还没来得及动手，毒蛇便猝然跃起咬了你一口，随即消失在了草丛里。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}中毒！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51640
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_fa28d8c6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}思忖片刻，你觉得这买卖不值当，便放过了那条蛇，回去继续自己的营生。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51643
translate chinese hunt_1_snake_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51648
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_54a8f231:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在康布雷周边勘察时，你信步走进城西一片小树林，却在一处窄径上与一名法国士兵撞了个脸对脸。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51650
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_9e279a44:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你当即握紧武器，可那法国兵非但没有拔剑相向，反倒连打手势，表明自己绝无恶意。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51652
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_d4f1e516:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}定睛细看，你发现此人确实构不成威胁：甲胄松松垮垮地挂在身上，体格也远非魁梧。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51654
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_97d63fec:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据这法国兵说，他本是取道康布雷，去往邻近的村子。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51656
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_092e7927:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可围城一开始，他便同许多人一道被征入了城里的民兵——但凡拿得动兵器的，市政当局都一股脑地塞了进来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51658
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_5675eb6c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过他本就无心作战，一逮着机会便开了小差，此刻正要赶回家去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51660
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_f694d955:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}察觉到你打量他装备的目光，这法国兵忽然开口：但凡你中意的，尽可买走——仗他是不打算打了，可多几枚弗罗林傍身，他倒求之不得……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51662
translate chinese hunt_1_deserter_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51666
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_f873a423:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边闲逛时，望见不远处山丘后升起的烟柱。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51668
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_a57b3910:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}赶过去一看，一座磨坊正烈焰升腾，主人呛得直咳、累得步履蹒跚，仍在一包包地把面粉往外搬。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51670
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_dc737a81:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你现身，他喜出望外，含泪恳求你帮他抢救家当。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51672
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51675
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_a8ea1604:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你应下此事，深吸一口气，冲了进去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51677
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_c61863ce:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在浓烟与烈火中辨不清方向的你，竟也硬生生拖出了几袋沉甸甸的面粉。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51679
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51681
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_519edb21:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}浓烟灌肺，你很快就觉得不适，所幸并无大碍。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51683
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_38784ef8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}虽然救出的面粉袋不多，磨坊主依然满怀感激，发誓余生都要为你的康健向主祈祷。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51686
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_6f90863e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与磨坊主作别，你继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51688
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51692
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_c30daf77:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而浓烟灌肺，你很快就觉得不适。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51695
