    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与磨坊主作别，你继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51700
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51705
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_fbc7f5c5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见磨坊已烧得如一支火炬，随时都会轰然倒塌，你决意不拿性命去赌。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51708
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_f7b8a72f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}磨坊主骂骂咧咧地诅咒着你，自己一头扎进火场，转眼便消失在浓烟之中。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51710
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_87d0af88:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}片刻之后，磨坊轰然坍塌，将他埋在了废墟之下。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51712
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_9bb5340f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你为他不幸的灵魂默念了一段安魂祷词，随即继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51714
translate chinese hunt_1_fire_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51719
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_32b3b004:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边闲逛时，见路上有一群神色惶惶的旅人，正围着一个躺倒在地的同伴。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51721
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_ee2cd80c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一瞧见你，他们便急忙迎上前来求援。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51723
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_a5b1a975:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据他们所言，那可怜人在林中寻到一枚怪蘑菇吃了下去，随后便急剧恶化，眼看着气息越来越弱。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51725
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_213ee320:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}毋庸置疑，若再拖延，这位不幸的旅人恐怕性命难保。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51727
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_end_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51736
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_b7fc1228:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}失去物品——[antidote.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51738
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51747
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_e18a462e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你应下此事，取出随身的药剂喂他服下，那人立时好转。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51749
translate chinese hunt_1_poison_ccfd8466:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}缓过气来的旅人连声道谢，为表深深的感激，赠了你一枚珍贵的戒指。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51753
