# game/script_dlc.rpy:51820
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_a810278d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在周边勘察时，你遇到了一位正从圣地返乡的朝圣骑士。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51822
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_0daf3724:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}骑士与你攀谈起来，饶有兴致地打听此地的近闻，听得颇为专注。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51824
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_10:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51831
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_dd43c053:

    "{cps=50}你的仪表与谈吐给骑士留下了极好的印象。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚、威望——完全成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51832
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_f1444f66:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}许是话到深处，他向你坦言：此番圣地之行非但没让他发财，反倒把他折腾得元气大伤。如今他正盘算着，投奔某位领主——或任何出得起饷银的雇主。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51834
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_778abf2e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}除却按时发饷，他唯一的要求是：将来的统帅须品行虔诚，且不能差遣他去做有辱骑士与基督徒名誉的差事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51836
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_4b446eef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在他看来，你正是合适的人选——若你队中尚有缺额，他很乐意加入……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51838
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_22c1715e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}十字军骑士 [squad_candidate_container_full_name!ti] 想加入你的队伍！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51840
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51844
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_6d10ed85:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}你的队伍已没有空位！{vspace=5}是否驱离一名队员？"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51849
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51855
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51861
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51867
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51871
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51875
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_23174da1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你应允了他的请求。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}[squad_candidate_container_full_name!ti] 加入了你的队伍。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51890
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51895
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_7973e429:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他的提议对你毫无吸引力，你谢绝了他的帮助。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51897
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51902
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_e98ab5b1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}满足了自己的好奇，又认定你是个虔诚之人，他向你道了谢，随即请你收下一份小小的礼物。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51905
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51910
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_ea6e3524:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}满足了自己的好奇之后，他向你道谢，随即径自上路，留你独自一人。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51912
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_menu_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51918
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_end_d94c2482:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}骑士与你热情作别，踏上了自己的路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51920
translate chinese hunt_1_crusader_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51925
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_34f16db6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边闲逛时，遇上一位云游货郎，兜售着形形色色的药剂、汤膏与药饮。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51927
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_4b00ddef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一瞧见你，他便迫不及待地吹嘘起自己的货物，盼着能哄你买上一两样。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51929
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_b4a07fbc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他举着数不清的瓶瓶罐罐在你眼前乱晃，嘴上喋喋不休：什么永生不死、牛一般的体魄、魔鬼般的运气、战场上的刀枪不入，全给许了个遍。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51931
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_183a8e65:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他的货架上赫然摆着……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51933
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_e2b22c74:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}龙之血——但凡饮下，便拥有铜皮铁骨般的好身板。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51935
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_71b75923:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}凤凰之泪——疗伤祛病，包治百恙。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51937
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_c576fd27:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}女巫汤剂——由法力高强的女巫亲手熬制，据说连死人也能从阴间拉回来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51939
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_592cae57:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}幸运精华——只消沾上一滴，保你此生诸事顺遂、鸿运当头。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51941
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_640e0e3b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……最后还有……{w}永生药水——喝了便能长生不老。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51943
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_bdd2537b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这位货郎，说得好听些是个来历可疑的角色，可他那些天花乱坠的许诺，确实叫人动心……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51945
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51951
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_538cff67:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}货郎喜滋滋地接过你递来的钱币，把货品交到你手上，随即狡黠一笑，转身溜走似地溜了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失 40 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51953
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_836250da:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}待你凑近细看，这瓶神乎其神的\"龙之血\"……竟不过是几口馊了的艾尔。你本想追上去把钱讨回来——兴许还能请他尝尝\"龙之血\"的滋味——可那人早已跑得无影无踪。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51955
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51960
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_d102d9e6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}金钱不足！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51962
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51967
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_538cff67_1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}货郎喜滋滋地接过你递来的钱币，把货品交到你手上，随即狡黠一笑，脚底抹油似地溜了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失 40 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51969
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_7a3b1305:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}待你凑近细看，这瓶神乎其神的\"凤凰之泪\"……竟不过是寻常的解毒剂，随便哪个军医的药箱里都翻得出一瓶。你本想追上去把钱讨回来——兴许还能让他也\"包治百恙\"一回——可那人早已跑得无影无踪。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:51971
