    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52025
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_85e7303b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不愿同这等来路不明的人物打交道，回绝了他的货物，径自离去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52027
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_menu_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52032
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_end_092831fb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52034
translate chinese hunt_1_alchemist_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52039
translate chinese hunt_1_contemplate_872a44e8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边信步闲游，骑马拐进一片小树林。叶声沙沙，令人心静，不时拂过的微风将你的思绪带向远方。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52041
translate chinese hunt_1_contemplate_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52043
translate chinese hunt_1_contemplate_c54ddda9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你忆起了伊娃，忆起了自己待她的种种。你爱过她吗？你当时可有别的选择？"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52045
translate chinese hunt_1_contemplate_78024b6a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若不是这场战争，一切是否会走向不同的结局？若不是有人死守着那些荒唐的命令——到头来终究一无所获……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52047
translate chinese hunt_1_contemplate_efb5ddde:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}往事如同一泓静湖，可你若频频潜入它平静的水面，潜得够深，它便轻易化作湍急的漩涡，将你拖向湖底，再不松手。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52049
translate chinese hunt_1_contemplate_791c2eb1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你挥去愁绪，继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52051
translate chinese hunt_1_contemplate_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52056
translate chinese hunt_1_contract_3d7d7530:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边闲逛时误入一片森林，其中一条小径上横着几具遍体伤痕的尸体。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52058
translate chinese hunt_1_contract_5edfb810:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}从衣着与残留的装备来看，死者应是一位出身显赫的战士，带着自己的队伍，倒在了与不明敌手的厮杀中——多半是遭了埋伏的强盗毒手。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52060
translate chinese hunt_1_contract_9f0afb5a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一推测的佐证在于：尸身被洗劫一空，唯有损毁严重或浸满血迹的物件被留了下来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52062
translate chinese hunt_1_contract_3e82733a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一只被弩箭射穿、里子朝外翻开的行囊里，只余一张羊皮纸。凑近细看，竟是国王签发的一纸军饷契约。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52064
translate chinese hunt_1_contract_77caf2ee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你顺手将它带在身上，以备不时之需，随后继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52066
translate chinese hunt_1_contract_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52071
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_85f5b6a2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边闲逛，不知不觉间便踏进了一片沼泽……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52073
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52075
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_c8e6400b:

    "{cps=50}……险些陷进泥潭。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52076
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_18b37d26:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你小心避开凶险之处，总算走出了沼泽，继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52079
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_c2f9dd60:

    "{cps=50}……一脚踩进了泥潭！{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52080
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_3eca43e5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你费了好大力气才挣脱出来，可此番遭遇并非全无代价。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}毒性上升！{vspace=5}疲劳上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52090
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52092
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_b2e10953:

    "{cps=50}你慌忙拔腿远离沼泽，途中还顺手摸走了几样稀罕的材料。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}运气——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52094
translate chinese hunt_1_swamp_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52099
translate chinese hunt_1_antiquarian_68ef5681:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边勘察时，路上遇到一位云游的古董商。一见你，他便忙不迭地夸耀起自己的货物，劝你买点什么，还口口声声许以实惠的价钱。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52101
translate chinese hunt_1_antiquarian_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52107
translate chinese hunt_1_antiquarian_end_2ab65b34:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你与古董商作别，继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52109
translate chinese hunt_1_antiquarian_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52115
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_14a96b00:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}穿行林中，你忽然瞥见一棵树梢上有金属的闪光。定睛一看，光是从一个喜鹊窝里透出来的——窝中似乎藏着什么值钱的东西。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52117
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_walk_past_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52162
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_c25313ce:

    "{cps=50}你端起弩仔细瞄准，一箭将鸟巢从枝头射落。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}弩术——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52163
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_b7a104fa:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}巢中之物便归你所有，权当收获。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52165
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52170
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_b83c198f:

    "{cps=50}你端起弩仔细瞄准，扣下扳机，却射了个空。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}弩术——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52171
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_dbae1ba2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一箭偏得离谱，你对命中鸟巢彻底失了信心——索性不再白白浪费弩箭。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52173
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52182
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_790e139e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这棵树虬枝盘错，看着不难攀爬——你便动手了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52190
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_76b1085f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你稳稳抓住枝干，向上攀去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量、运气——成功！{vspace=5}疲劳等级上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52194
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_231a493b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可臂力很快就撑不住了，你失手摔了下来。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}力量、运气——失败！{vspace=5}活力-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52197
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52205
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_75acdb6c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你灵巧地攀枝踏干，轻松登上了树顶。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、运气——成功！{vspace=5}疲劳等级上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52209
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_a3f954f5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼看就要攀到树顶，你伸手去抓一根枝条，却手下一滑。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、运气——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52211
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_d8d71d26:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}失去支撑，你坠向地面，摔得不轻。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力-2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52214
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52222
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_1f566238:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你攀上树顶，从窝里取出那枚闪亮的宝贝，又稳稳落回地面。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调、运气——成功！{vspace=5}疲劳等级上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52225
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52228
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_31937e76:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你攀上树顶，探手进鸟巢去掏那枚闪亮的宝贝，可就在最后一刻，脚下突然一滑……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调、运气——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52230
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_666b032b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……你重重摔落在地，撞得不轻。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力-3！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52233
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_climb_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52237
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_fail_5d28d25a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你骂骂咧咧地揉着淤青的地方，朝那棵倒霉的树啐了一口，便继续赶路办自己的事去了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52239
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_fail_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52243
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_success_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52245
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_success_9931d142:

    "{cps=50}重新回到安全之地，你这才得空细细端详起弄到手的物件……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52246
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_success_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52252
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_walk_past_28a2d97d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定从旁绕开。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52254
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_walk_past_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52260
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_end_0036343a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你把战利品塞进口袋，继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52262
translate chinese hunt_1_nest_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52268
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_7c3b71ac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在康布雷周边闲逛时，一条林道上撞见了一幅惨象：一辆被强盗洗劫一空的货车，看来属于某个小商贩。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52270
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_4c0a8f01:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}货车主人连同两名同伴就倒在不远处——路边沟渠里，颅骨尽碎。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52273
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52277
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_3a92aeb4:

    "{cps=50}你花了几个小时掘坑备坟，将这些不幸之人安葬入土，送他们最后一程。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}时间流逝：2{vspace=5}美德+15！{vspace=5}疲劳等级上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52283
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_f1842128:

    "{cps=50}你心想死人用不着财物，便在车上翻找起凶徒漏下的值钱物件。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52284
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52286
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_322501f6:

    "{cps=50}车里没寻到什么特别值钱的东西，唯有一口不起眼却相当结实的箱子。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}获得储物箱！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52291
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52295
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_7368f615:

    "{cps=50}你决定不作停留，继续去办自己的事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52298
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_e72513c7:

    "{cps=50}这里没有值得逗留的缘由，你便继续去办自己的事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52299
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52305
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_end_30dcef81:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}将寻获之物收归己有，你继续赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52307
translate chinese hunt_1_wagon_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52314
translate chinese hunt_1_interlude_b816fd34:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你摆出真正领主的派头，组织了一场盛大的狩猎，满载而归。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52316
translate chinese hunt_1_interlude_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52321
translate chinese hunt_1_damietta_bandits_5b26328b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}离开达米埃塔城墙下的相对安全之地，你决定勘察一番周边的地带。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52323
translate chinese hunt_1_damietta_bandits_bcc3ac22:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你刚离开城池没多远，便被一伙劫匪团团围住……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52325
translate chinese hunt_1_damietta_bandits_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52337
translate chinese hunt_1_york_cultists_2a8328da:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}离开约克城墙下的相对安全之地，你决定勘察一番周边的地带。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52339
translate chinese hunt_1_york_cultists_fc568d6c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你刚离开城池没多远，便被一群形貌古怪的劫匪团团围住……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52341
translate chinese hunt_1_york_cultists_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52353
translate chinese hunt_1_null_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52355
translate chinese hunt_1_null_4a2155d9:

    "{cps=50}你在周边游荡了几个小时，却一无所遇，平平无奇。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52356
translate chinese hunt_1_null_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52363
translate chinese hunt_2_0065190d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你使上狩猎的装备，猎得些许野味，预备拿去贩卖。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52365
translate chinese hunt_2_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52367
translate chinese hunt_2_61c9c406:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}[sword.name!ti]——成功！{vspace=5}获得 35 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52369
translate chinese hunt_2_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52371
translate chinese hunt_2_1de9b469:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}[hunting_knife.name!ti]——成功！{vspace=5}获得 20 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52374
translate chinese hunt_2_f65754f8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}凭着猎人天赋，你猎得些许小野味，拿去换了些钱。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}获得 20 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52376
translate chinese hunt_2_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52378
translate chinese hunt_2_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52445
translate chinese hunt_2_treasure_9d13d38c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途之上，你无意间撞见一处藏得拙劣的金子暗窖。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52448
translate chinese hunt_2_treasure_1099d65e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}+40 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52452
translate chinese hunt_2_treasure_f6e14a2f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}+55 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52456
translate chinese hunt_2_treasure_04adbdee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}+65 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52460
translate chinese hunt_2_treasure_0e600b68:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}+75 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52466
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52468
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_484367fb:

    "{cps=50}在林中穿行之际，一种不祥之感渐渐攫住了你，而且愈演愈烈。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52469
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_9171ba09:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这股预感绝非空穴来风——你冷不丁迎面撞上一头膘肥体壮的野猪。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52471
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52473
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_722bf3c7:

    "{cps=50}所幸你手中的猎剑立刻派上了用场，三下五除二便结果了这头凶兽。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52475
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52479
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_5a4030cf:

    "{cps=50}所幸你手中的翼矛立刻派上了用场，三两下便结果了这头凶兽。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52481
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52484
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_8655f5ad:

    "{cps=50}暴怒的野兽当即朝你扑来，逼得你转身就逃。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52485
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52489
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_6af11b14:

    "{cps=50}谢天谢地，你的耐力尚算过硬，一双快腿驮着你安然逃离了这头怪物。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52491
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_60ce8619:

    "{cps=50}你费了九牛二虎之力才从兽口脱身，这场追逐把你累得筋疲力尽，回去之后恐怕得歇上好一阵子。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力检定失败！{vspace=5}疲劳等级上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52493
translate chinese hunt_2_boar_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52497
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52499
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_70e0347e:

    "{cps=50}归途之中，你听见不远处传来狼嗥。你不想在林子里同狼群照面，不由得加快了脚步……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52500
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52502
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_c21fbc0c:

    "{cps=50}多亏脚上这双好靴子，你脚下生风，转眼便安然跑出了林子。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}小饰品检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52503
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52507
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_3351bf9a:

    "{cps=50}可这并不顶用——不出十分钟，一小群狼便围拢上来，明显来者不善。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52508
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_85b5da1a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}逃跑已无意义，你只得拔剑应战。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52510
translate chinese hunt_2_wolves_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52515
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52517
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_68a171b0:

    "{cps=50}归途之上，你稍稍偏离了熟悉的道路，想探一探未曾涉足的地方。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52518
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_ff42b2e9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而这个决定显然不甚明智——约莫半个时辰后，你便发现自己迷了路，完全辨不清方位，也不知该往哪里走。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52520
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_d59a1af1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼下的唯一出路便是先随便走一走——你也就这么做了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52522
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_3093932e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}大约转悠了一个时辰，命运总算又向你露出笑脸，你找到了一座小村庄。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52524
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_f31293f2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}村中居民热情得有些过头——你不过是想问个路，他们却把你奉若贵宾，非要你好好领略一番乡村的款待之道。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52526
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_a35e36b6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}路终究是给你指了，不过得先洗个澡，再赴一席好菜、美酒与歌声齐备的盛宴。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52528
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_950a7d72:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这番盛情显然对身子大有裨益，只是时间也耗费了不少。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力+1！{vspace=5}时间流逝：3。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52532
translate chinese hunt_2_peasants_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52537
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52539
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_753855fc:

    "{cps=50}归途之上，你头顶的阴云急剧聚拢，转瞬便落下了瓢泼大雨。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52540
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_f4e32c0e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不想被淋个透湿，便四下寻找避雨之处，在林中发现了一间猎人小屋。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52542
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_278db343:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}看样子，这是专为应付风雨或诸如此类的变故而备下的临时栖身之所。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52544
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_76e3527e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这场雨绵延不绝，害得你枯坐干等，白白耗去了不少时辰……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}距下个事件时间：-2"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52547
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_45d56208:

    nvl clear
    "……不过雨水倒是把主人家摆下接水的一只小皮囊灌了个满满当当。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52549
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52552
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_a3ddb456:

    "{cps=50}你将这个皮囊收归己有。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-5。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52557
translate chinese hunt_2_rain_c49cb53e:

    "{cps=50}你决定不擅动他人物品。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+5。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52563
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_f3f612cb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}穿过密林，你来到一小片空地，上面搭着一座用树枝与苔藓草草拼就的窝棚，看痕迹是近日才仓促搭成的。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52565
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_da57876f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你匆匆打量了一番这处居所，只见生过火的痕迹，还有吃剩的残渣——啃剩的苹果核、剔净的兽骨，外加两只喝空的艾尔酒瓶。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52567
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_05a6a0e5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，你还没来得及在脑中盘算出此间主人的来头，这居所的主人便自己现身了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52569
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_fd44a8ea:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}空地另一侧的树丛里，钻出一个形容邋遢的持械男子，怀里抱着一捆柴火。他那满身泥污的衣衫被树枝刮得破烂不堪，可上面的一些纹章图案依然隐约可辨……而这些图案，你总觉得眼熟得可疑。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52571
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_d14cd0c4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52573
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_db69d7f1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你敢拿性命打赌，眼前之人就是个开了小差的逃兵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52575
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_0d3ca096:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一见你，那陌生人便当即握紧武器，朝你这边逼了过来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52577
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52580
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_7bd8702e:

    "{cps=50}你不想无谓流血，便试着劝解这名逃兵，好让他相信你对他并无威胁。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52582
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_cf8f61d9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可他听了只是放声大笑——说你连护甲都没有，对他哪来的威胁。既然如此，杀你比冒险留你活口要省事得多。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52585
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52589
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_0453aa84:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的话让他沉吟起来。从这逃兵的神色与举动来看，他分明已是穷途末路——放你活着，他冒的风险未必比与你一战更小。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52591
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_ca8d8e5e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}踌躇片刻，他终究还是愿意信你一回，但要你立誓绝不向任何人泄露他的藏身之处。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52594
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52598
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_721bc7ee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他愣了一瞬，若有所思……可旋即甩开这些念头，声称他信不过你，你迟早会把他供出去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52601
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52607
translate chinese hunt_2_deserter_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52612
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52614
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_32ae4943:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途之上，你撞见一伙劫匪——他们专门守在这条路上，打劫过往的行人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52616
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_2a7fa58a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们把你当成了同道中人，便放你通行。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}低虔诚——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52618
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52621
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52625
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_84baf754:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你并无同流合污之意，径直向他们发起了攻击。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52627
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52632
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_20d311cb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途之上，几个面目不善的农民忽然拦住了你的去路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52634
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52636
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_8e0fb66b:

    "{cps=50}他们索取\"过路费\"——走\"他们的路\"须得付钱，只要给钱，便不为难你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52637
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52639
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_90197fd0:

    "{cps=50}过路的价码是 [trait] 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52640
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52644
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_ac0102d1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定不冒无谓的风险，遂照价付了钱。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52646
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_c8137643:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}别看这些农民一副靠不住的样子，倒还言而有信，二话不说便放你走了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52649
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52653
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_883a7742:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可把血汗钱分给一帮蹬鼻子上脸的乡巴佬劫匪——这种事你绝不干。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52655
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_3e592b10:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}谈判显然已陷入僵局，看来只好用武力解决了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52657
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52662
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_2c11aa8f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们索取\"过路费\"——走\"他们的路\"须得付钱，只要给钱，便不为难你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52664
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_c618c8ff:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}过路的价码是 10 弗罗林。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52666
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_a4da6043:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你身上可没有这笔钱。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52668
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_e2415d2e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听你这么说，这些农民摊开双手，故作懊恼地表示：既然如此，他们只好没收你全部财物，变卖了抵你的债了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52670
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_94482c5c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这样的结局你自然不肯认，于是握住了剑柄。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52672
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52678
translate chinese hunt_2_cultists_66e13f2f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途起初平安无事。{w}可每走一步，那种被人暗中窥视的感觉便愈发强烈，怎么也甩不掉。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52680
translate chinese hunt_2_cultists_d89e0a79:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途之上，几个形迹可疑的家伙忽然拦住了你的去路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52682
translate chinese hunt_2_cultists_cc3e09ba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}起初你只当他们是寻常的劫匪，可很快便察觉出异样——这些人不大对劲。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52684
translate chinese hunt_2_cultists_0d1d1154:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}仿佛印证你的预感，那些陌生人连话都懒得多说一句、要求也懒得提，径直亮出了兵器……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52686
translate chinese hunt_2_cultists_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52692
translate chinese hunt_2_marauders_f1d6aea4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途之上，你路过一座不过十来户人家的小村——正有一伙掠夺者在其中洗劫。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52694
translate chinese hunt_2_marauders_133ab8c0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}惊恐万状的村民纷纷向你求救。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52698
translate chinese hunt_2_marauders_ac2c838c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你素来不是见死不救之人，便应下替他们收拾这帮恶徒。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+15！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52701
translate chinese hunt_2_marauders_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52707
translate chinese hunt_2_marauders_c92f8b0c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不想卷进这场凶险的祸事，便回绝了插手。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-30！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52710
translate chinese hunt_2_marauders_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52715
translate chinese hunt_2_bear_trap_1f98d4a6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}归途之上，你不知不觉间踏进了某处猎场……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52717
translate chinese hunt_2_bear_trap_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52720
translate chinese hunt_2_bear_trap_22d4f164:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……只差一步，你就踩进了一口巨大的捕熊铁夹——那玩意儿轻轻松松就能夹断你一条腿。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}运气、协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52722
translate chinese hunt_2_bear_trap_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52725
translate chinese hunt_2_bear_trap_1371cb07:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}……你一脚踩进了铁夹，被夹得皮开肉绽。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}运气、协调——失败！{vspace=5}活力-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52728
translate chinese hunt_2_bear_trap_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52733
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_364db590:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在周边闲逛时，遇上一位带着随从出猎的阔绰贵人。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52735
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_76b2fe88_4:

