# game/script_dlc.rpy:52737
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_84dec1f7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}看出你是个体面人，这位兴致正高的贵人便邀你同行。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52743
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_be9ceaec:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}狩猎结束，你的身手让贵人刮目相看，他赠了你一份礼物。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}弩术——成功！{vspace=5}时间流逝：1。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52746
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52750
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_1d9ae7a4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}狩猎途中，你想露一手好本事，可惜没能震住任何人。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}弩术——失败！{vspace=5}时间流逝：1。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52752
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52755
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_1a4868be:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不想把时辰耗在这种消遣上，便婉言谢绝了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52757
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52760
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_9473c0ab:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你这副模样实在让人信不过，他们目不斜视地打马而过。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望——失败（需要：30）！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52762
translate chinese hunt_2_hunt_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52766
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_f9aaffb7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你没能算准时间，赶不上在天黑前回营，只得在暮色四合中摸黑赶路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52768
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52771
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_897c7ba5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过你走得小心翼翼，险要之处一概绕开。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}运气、协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52773
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52776
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_6ad06bcf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}绕过一道深沟时，你一步踏空，被虬结的树根绊住，重心一失，整个人骨碌碌滚进了沟里。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}运气、协调——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52778
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52780
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_761a054c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一跤摔得极重，想不受伤也难。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}脑震荡！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52785
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52788
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_a2d400bc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一跤摔得极重，想不受伤也难。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52791
translate chinese hunt_2_fall_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52795
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_2abecdd3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}岔路口上，你遇见一位身形魁伟、全副武装的骑手，胯下一匹高大战马。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52797
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_9a7902e0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那陌生人主动上前搭话，自称雅克·德·博瓦里，是一名游历四方、遍寻棋逢对手之人的游侠骑士。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52799
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_80e242e8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据这骑手所言，他闯荡至今，三百场对决三百胜，还从未有对手能逼近胜利。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52801
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88_12:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52804
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_fdee5948:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说你接下挑战，雅克·德·博瓦里满意地点了点头，并祈请上帝亲临见证这场比试，将胜利赐予强者。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52806
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_81b47adc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这番话，他是背对着你、朝相反方向驰去时说的。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52808
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_34496f5d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}驰出约百步，骑士不作片刻迟疑，也不出言警示，啪地扣下面甲，端起长枪，双腿一夹，催马直直朝你冲来。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52810
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_febb10ba:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你心知与这尊铁甲巨兽正面相撞无异于送死，便把宝押在敏捷上，试图闪开他这一击。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52812
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52814
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_2ea046e4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这招奏效了——最后一瞬，你堪堪闪出了他的冲锋路线。骑士被你骤变的身法晃了个措手不及，慌乱间猛夹马腹，战马当即人立而起——他因此失守了片刻。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52816
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_1b80f08e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你抓住这个破绽，使出全力朝他没护到的部位狠狠一击，将他打落马下，双方这才回到同一条线上……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52819
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52824
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_d88482fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这招没能奏效：时机差了半分，你只来得及闪开半边，长枪的沉重一击仍砸在你身上，将你掀翻在地。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52828
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_fbf72b52:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这招没能奏效：时机差了半分，你只来得及闪开半边，长枪的沉重一击仍砸在你身上，将你掀翻在地。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}脑震荡！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52834
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52837
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_4ac233e9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}与大地的一记亲密接触倒让你彻底清醒过来——双方实力悬殊，根本不是一回事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52839
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_0c68111b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你开口讨饶。骑士不愧是有荣誉感的人，接受了你的认输，放你离去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-10！{vspace=5}威望-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52843
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52849
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_d685c895:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}骑士再次催马冲来，你无计可施，只好把同样的法子再使一遍。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52851
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52853
