# game/script_dlc.rpy:52912
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_c604152b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}见你已爬不起来，骑士单方面宣布比试结束，并自居胜者。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52914
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_82d5887c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}随后，他谢过你此番陪练，祝你早日痊愈，便策马离去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52916
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_9293318f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你躺了好一阵，总算勉强撑起身子，一瘸一拐地往回走……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52918
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52923
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_002a25fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}午后再跟一位骑着高头战马的铁甲骑士来场决斗？这可不在此刻的安排之内。你客气地谢绝了这场比试——宁可折点颜面，也要保住身子骨。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-15！{vspace=5}威望-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52927
translate chinese hunt_2_wandering_knight_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52932
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_6d91b726:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你骑马穿过附近的一片林子，忽然听见密林深处传来打斗之声。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52934
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52937
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_18c5b5f8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你没有凑这份热闹的心思，继续走自己的路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52939
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52943
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_dff9addc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你急于弄清原委，循声赶去，很快便来到一片空地——只见一名骑士正被数名强盗围在当中，独自苦苦支撑。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52945
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_88e48ded:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们打得正酣，谁也没有注意到你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52947
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52950
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_4ece7863:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不想卷进这等麻烦，转身避了开去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52953
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52957
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_24801a79:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的荣誉感不容你坐视他人陷入危难，你当即冲上前去援手。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+10！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52961
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52965
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_65244afc:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼见那被围的骑士像是砧板上的鱼肉，你也加入了强盗的行列，朝他一拥而上。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德-30！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52969
translate chinese hunt_2_knight_v_bandits_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52976
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52979
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_0a748c33:

    "{cps=50}你在周边勘察时误入密林深处，林间最深处竟藏着一座破败的墓穴。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52980
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52983
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_5014a6af:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}好奇心占了上风，你试着钻进去一探究竟。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52986
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_141c9539:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}封住入口的是一扇厚重的橡木门，已半腐烂——任凭你使多大劲，也推它不动。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52988
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_e0ec92d8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若是更敬畏神明的美德信徒，恐怕早已将此视为天意、就此作罢；可你不为所动。脑筋一转，不多时便寻到法子，从坍塌的屋顶钻进了墓穴。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}低美德——成功！{vspace=5}时间流逝：1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52992
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_f12eed8d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你轻巧地纵身跃下，落进一片浓稠的黑暗。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}协调——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52995
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_e1a3f609:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你从屋顶跃入墓穴的黑暗，落地却失了准头，摔出了伤。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}协调——失败！{vspace=5}活力-2！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:52999
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_1cb1b2c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}待双眼适应了黑暗，你仔细打量起四周。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53001
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_586bfb03:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}墓穴里并无什么特别的东西——但凡值点钱的，看来早已在你之前被搬空了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53003
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53009
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_fa73ca22:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过，一番仔细搜寻之后，运气终于还是向你露出了笑脸。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}运气——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53013
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_71f79e10:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你只翻出几件早已锈透的兵甲残片。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}运气——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53016
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53020
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_8a882d95:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可任你使尽气力，那扇厚重的半烂橡木门依然纹丝不动。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53022
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_49aa2f09:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你觉得这兴许是天意如此，便折回了路上。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}低美德——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53024
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53028
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_c1b41e89:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你决定绕开此处，折回了路上。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53030
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53035
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_5cee03f6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}待到该出去时，你才发觉：想从进来的路离开墓穴，根本行不通。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53037
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53039
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_bf9f0ba9:

    "{cps=50}所幸你的力气还够用——从里面死命顶住大门，终于挤开一道缝，侧身钻了出去。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53041
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_df2875df:

    "{cps=50}如今只剩大门一条出路，可你的力气依旧不足以让它松动分毫。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}力量——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53042
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_4c146048:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}结果，你只得花上几个时辰，一寸一寸地把它慢慢挪开。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}时间流逝：1！疲劳等级上升！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53044
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53047
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_5d79f0fb:

    "{cps=50}到头来，你总算挪出了一道堪堪容身的缝隙，侧身挤了出去。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53048
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53058
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_68a171b0:

    "{cps=50}归途之上，你稍稍偏离了熟悉的道路，想探一探未曾涉足的地方。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53059
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_ff42b2e9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而这个决定显然不甚明智——约莫半个时辰后，你便发现自己迷了路，完全辨不清方位，也不知该往哪里走。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53061
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_d59a1af1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}眼下的唯一出路便是先随便走一走——你也就这么做了。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53063
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_3093932e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}大约转悠了一个时辰，命运总算又向你露出笑脸，你找到了一座小村庄。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53065
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_f31293f2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}村中居民热情得有些过头——你不过是想问个路，他们却把你奉若贵宾，非要你好好领略一番乡村的款待之道。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53067
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_a35e36b6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}路终究是给你指了，不过得先洗个澡，再赴一席好菜、美酒与歌声齐备的盛宴。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53069
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_950a7d72:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这番盛情显然对身子大有裨益，只是时间也耗费了不少。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}活力+1！{vspace=5}时间流逝：3。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53073
translate chinese hunt_2_mausoleum_end_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53077
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53081
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_2eb565bb:

    "{cps=50}归途之上，你在一处山丘顶歇了歇脚——这里视野开阔，四周景致尽收眼底。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53082
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_9d4bfe66:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}歇息间，你望见一支小小的车队正朝你这边驶来——三辆马车，满载各色货物。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53084
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_078567cd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你这双惯于掂量黑活的眼立刻看出：别看货物沉重，这车队却几乎毫无防卫。除开几个显然不擅打斗的胖商人，护送的只有两个装备平平的农民打手。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}低美德——成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53086
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_dd7d1244:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这般寒酸的护卫，或许能挡一挡三两个瘦弱的小贼或饿急眼的偷猎者，可要对付你——远远不够。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53088
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_20d2390a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这肥美的一口，仿佛自己送到了嘴边……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53090
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53093
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_20bcd8b8:

    "{cps=50}等车队驶近，你拦住了去路，要他们分出一部分货物。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53095
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_5d62be37:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的话语气森然，你的气度也足以让人明白——你是个惹不起的角色，既然开口，必有缘由。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望——完全成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53097
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_1acec0b3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}吓破胆的商人们奉上 250 弗罗林，只求平安通过。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53101
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_ed854f23:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的话语气森然，稳重的仪表也印证了你绝非儿戏。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望——部分成功！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53103
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_c71f0a0e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}吓破胆的商人们奉上 100 弗罗林，只求平安通过。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53107
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_6fcff3b6:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你的话语气森然，可你这副模样实在让人生不出多少敬畏。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望——失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53109
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_496e44c5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}商人们喝令护卫来收拾你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53111
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53116
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53119
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_ec5215d9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这个条件合你心意，你便应下了。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}获得 [hunt_2_caravan] 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53122
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53126
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_74967df8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这点可怜的封口费可满足不了你——你亮出兵器，准备用强夺下货物。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}美德-20！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53130
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53135
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_59ffc5e3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不想平白作下这份孽，便放车队通行。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}美德+5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53138
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53153
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53156
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_end_0777b2f0:

    "{cps=50}你还在收拾护卫的当口，商人们早已四散逃进灌木丛保命，货物尽数留给了你劫掠。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53157
translate chinese hunt_2_caravan_end_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53164
translate chinese hunt_2_peasant_fair_1c78af48:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在康布雷周边勘察时，恰好路过一座小村庄，机缘巧合之下正赶上一场集市。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53166
translate chinese hunt_2_peasant_fair_f57816e2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}集市上大多是乡民常用的粗货，不过——谁知道呢？兴许真能淘到什么宝贝……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53168
translate chinese hunt_2_peasant_fair_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53171
translate chinese hunt_2_peasant_fair_fd8b43a8:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}时间流逝：2。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53177
translate chinese hunt_2_peasant_fair_028d380e:

    "{cps=50}你决定不在此浪费时间。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53178
translate chinese hunt_2_peasant_fair_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53184
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_d8b1974a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在郊野四处巡游时，你偶遇了一众云游朝圣的僧侣。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53186
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53189
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_0f320446:

    "{cps=50}你屈膝跪在他们面前，请求赐福，如愿以偿。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德——成功（[storyroll]）！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53190
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53193
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_cbcfd86b:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}武器已受赐福！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53194
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53197
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_cb1ca2bb:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得战斗祝福！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53200
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_cb1ca2bb_1:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得战斗祝福！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53203
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_cb1ca2bb_2:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得战斗祝福！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53205
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_1340b6e3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}僧侣们戒备地瞥着你，宁愿与你保持距离，随即匆匆离去了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚——失败（[storyroll]）！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53207
translate chinese hunt_2_monks_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53214
translate chinese hawkwood_scout_hunt_2ea834f4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}折返特雷维索途中，一伙武装暴徒突然从林间窜出伏击，显然是打着生擒你的算盘。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53216
