# game/script_dlc.rpy:53670
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_2f9cedd0:

    "{cps=50}骑士阵亡了，他的装备成了你的战利品。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}美德+10！{vspace=5}威望+1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53675
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_3baf6250:

    "{cps=50}骑士战死沙场，不过你总算是击败了那帮强盗。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53677
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_9f53b5c6:

    "{cps=50}骑士谢过你的援手，并将自己的匕首赠你作为答谢。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53679
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_043e1e5d:

    "{cps=50}你们合力干掉了骑士，随后瓜分了他的装备。大头自然归了强盗们，不过你也分到了一些。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53683
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_918bb0e6:

    "{cps=50}敌人尽数伏诛，你得以搜刮他们的尸体。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53684
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53722
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_cc5eb60a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}幸好，打斗声引来了附近巡逻的一小队英军士兵。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}声望（军士）检定通过！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53724
translate chinese hunt_2_bandits_fight_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:53732
