# game/script_dlc.rpy:65853
translate chinese training_encounter_0d8f9ce8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}训练时，一位旗队骑士随行的一名骑士侍从忽然凑了过来，想找民兵里的谁切磋切磋。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65855
translate chinese training_encounter_6126bcfe:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}仗着自己武艺高强，他行事极为轻狂，出手全是不留分寸的险招，稍不留神就能把人打成重伤。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65857
translate chinese training_encounter_34517b48:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}轮到你与他搭对时，这侍从愈发肆无忌惮，剑刃好几次擦着你的咽喉掠了过去，只差半寸。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65859
translate chinese training_encounter_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65862
translate chinese training_encounter_7be3d316:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这番行径叫你心头火起，你当面斥责了这名侍从。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65864
translate chinese training_encounter_b91c2360:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他却当面大笑——说你既然又笨拙又胆小，那不如放下兵器，改拿扫帚拖把吧。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65866
translate chinese training_encounter_886faa5e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}恰在此时，那位骑士手下又有几名骑士侍从来到训练场，将你们一干人轰了出去——受的羞辱无处讨回，训练也就此不了了之。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}训练失败！{vspace=5}威望-1！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65869
translate chinese training_encounter_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65874
translate chinese training_encounter_75011d91:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这番行径叫你心头火起，你决意教训教训这侍从，以牙还牙地回敬他那些狠招。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65876
translate chinese training_encounter_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65878
translate chinese training_encounter_39065334:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那侍从没料到这一手，当场乱了方寸——慌乱后退避你凌厉的攻势时失了平衡，一屁股跌进泥里，逗得你同伴和围观的人群哄堂大笑。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65880
translate chinese training_encounter_7ca38d6f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}武器技能——成功！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）+5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65882
translate chinese training_encounter_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65897
translate chinese training_encounter_16f45925:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而技艺差距实在悬殊——他毫不费力地闪过你笨拙的突刺，顺势一绊，让你扑进泥里，四周的看客哄笑一片。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}武器技能——失败！{vspace=5}声望（士兵）-5！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65899
translate chinese training_encounter_c1dfdc87:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你从泥里爬起，正要再扑上去接着打，那位骑士手下又有几名骑士侍从来到训练场，将你们一干人轰了出去——受的羞辱无处讨回，训练也就此不了了之。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}训练失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65902
translate chinese training_encounter_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65907
translate chinese training_encounter_be7d734e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你权当没看见他的做派。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65909
translate chinese training_encounter_3bdff7b9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}所幸你没有受伤，可这场训练终究是被搅黄了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}训练失败！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65911
translate chinese training_encounter_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65916
translate chinese soldiers_jealous_b23ed6af:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}行军数月，你习惯从阵亡敌军身上搜刮一切值钱物件的名声，渐渐传遍了多数同伴的耳朵。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65918
translate chinese soldiers_jealous_ea25f842:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}传言你攒了不少贵重战利品，这显然让他们心里直痒痒——终于有一天，他们几个结伴堵住你，要跟你\"谈谈\"。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65920
translate chinese soldiers_jealous_b4f9125f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们团团围住你，还搭着你的肩膀套近乎，提醒你：战争是大家的买卖，单枪匹马成不了事——再机灵再油滑也一样。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65922
translate chinese soldiers_jealous_50aec399:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因此，照他们的说法，你最好认下他们的功劳，像刀口舔血的兄弟该做的那样——有好处，分一份。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65924
translate chinese soldiers_jealous_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:65927
translate chinese soldiers_jealous_76b2fe88:

