# game/script_dlc.rpy:67920
translate chinese thieves_guild_70792f43:

    "{cps=50}你盘算着在巴黎干几桩见不得光的买卖，便同当地的黑道人物搭上了线。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67921
translate chinese thieves_guild_0f49f495:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而，与巴黎那帮恶徒的会面并没有按你的设想进行……"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67923
translate chinese thieves_guild_3221407e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不知怎的，他们对你在鲁昂的勾当一清二楚——知道你是如何先博取当地帮派头目的信任，再把他出卖给城防卫兵的。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67925
translate chinese thieves_guild_027a806c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}有鉴于此，巴黎的恶徒们放出话来：如今你欠了道上的一笔账，要偿清有两条路。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67927
translate chinese thieves_guild_1ed2b071:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}要么奉上一笔不小的钱——[paris_gang_demanded_sum] 弗罗林，要么替他们办点活儿。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67929
translate chinese thieves_guild_b80478fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}否则，他们扬言要狠狠教训你。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67931
translate chinese thieves_guild_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67937
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_a6c83c96:

    "{cps=50}你决定用钱来偿清这笔债。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失 [paris_gang_demanded_sum] 弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67939
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_9fc0c253:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}收下钱后，恶徒们声称与你两清，今后乐意同你做买卖。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67942
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67954
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_d3f4841b:

    "{cps=50}你说自己愿意奉上这笔钱，只是凑齐如此巨款需要时日。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67955
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_34f92db9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}恶徒们答应宽限几天，不过劝你莫要试探他们的耐心。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加——[in_bandits_debt.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67957
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67965
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_708341c8:

    "{cps=50}你应下替恶徒们办一件差事。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67966
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_6ceaffc3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们指派你去除掉敌对帮派的头目——阿拉贡的劳尔，此人正躲藏在城外自己的炼金实验室里。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67968
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_5ea70827:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}巴黎的恶徒们与他积怨已久，可劳尔精于毒物，谁也不愿平白招惹他——这其中的缘由自是不言自明。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67970
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_f6fe3253:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如今有了你，这个难题或许便有了解法。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67972
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_781f2a3a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们明白这不是件轻松的差事，便同意给你几天准备的时间，不过劝你莫要试探他们的耐心。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}新任务已添加——[in_bandits_debt.name!ti]。"

# game/script_dlc.rpy:67974
translate chinese player_broke_pact_with_rouen_bandits_menu_76b2fe88_2:

